 "MY-H1029": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1029",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Price Marking of Price-Controlled Goods) (No. 3) Order 2022.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 26 April 2022 to 6 May 2022.\n\nPrice marking"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Any person who sells or offers to sell any price-controlled goods published\nin the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering (Determination of Maximum Price)  (No. 4)\nOrder 20 22 [P.U. (A) 121 /2022] shall affix a pink coloured label indicating the price\nper unit or per unit weight, the name describing such price-controlled goods and the\ngrade or quality, if any, of such price-controlled goods.\n\n (2) Any person who fails to comply with subparagraph (1) commits\nan offence and shall, on conviction, be liable—\n\n(a) if such person is a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding\ntwenty thousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence,\nto a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit; or\n\n(b) if such person is not a body corporate, to a fine not exc eeding\nten thousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence,\nto a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit.\n\nMade 15 April 2022\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/Jld. 31]\n\n      DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
