 "MY-H1044": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1044",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Malaysian Biofuel Industry (Exemption)\n\nOrder 2024.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 15 May 2024.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Minister exempts a researcher in any higher educational institution\n\nor research institution in Malaysia from the application of paragraphs 5(1)(a), (b), (c),\n\n(f), (g), (h) and (i) of the Act in respect of activities relating to biofuel.\n\nCondition of exemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a) the activities relating to biofuel shall be for the purposes of research\n\nonly; and\n\n(b) the quantity of biofuel used in the activities relating to biofuel shall not\n\nexceed 200 litres.\n\nMade 6 May 2024\n\n[MPIC.BBA(S).700-1/1/1 Jld. 2 (8); PN(PU2)665/JLD.3]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\n\nMinister of Plantation and Commodities"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
