 "MY-H1053": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1053",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Co-operative Societies (Assumption of\n\nControl of Koperasi Sakilan Sandakan Berhad) (Reappointment) Order 2020.\n\n(2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 17 November 2017.\n\nReappointment of assumption of control"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Commission has reappointed Kastian bin Hj. Dula to assume control\n\nof the whole of the property, business, activities and affairs of the Koperasi\n\nSakilan Sandakan Berhad, and carry on the whole of its business, activities\n\nand affairs for the period from 17 November 2017 until 27 October 2018.\n\nCosts and expenses"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any costs and expenses incurred by the Commission, and the remuneration\n\nof the person reappointed under paragraph 2, in relation to the assumption of\n\ncontrol under paragraph 2 shall be payable out of the funds and properties of\n\nthe Koperasi Sakilan Sandakan Berhad as a first charge.\n\nMade 23 April 2020\n\n[SKM.IP(SULIT)(KP): 8274/1/3; PN(PU2)527/XIX]\n\n Datuk Nordin bin Salleh\n\nExecutive Chairman\n\nMalaysia Co-operative Societies Commission\n\nP.U. (A) 124."
    }
   }
  ]
 },
