     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti-Profiteering   (De-\ntermination of Maximum Price) (No. 6) Order 2023.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 15 April 2023 to 30 April 2023.\n\nMaximum wholesale price"
