     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Customs Duties\n\n(Goods under the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement)\n\n(Amendment) Order 2026.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 31 March 2026.\n\nAmendment of Second Schedule"
