 "MY-H1101": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1101",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Members of Parliament\n(Remuneration) (Amendment of First Schedule) Order 1996 and\nshall be deemed to have come into force on 5 April 1995."
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The First Schedule to the Members of Parliament (Remuneration)\nAct 1980 is amended by inserting after paragraph 4 the following\n\nparagraph:\n\n\"ce\n\nGratuity\n\nfor certain\nmembers of\nthe Administra-\ntion upon\ndissolution\n\nof Parliament,\n\n4a. (1) Without prejudice to paragraph 4, a Member of\nthe Administration who is a Member of the House of\nRepresentatives may, upon dissolution of Parliament, be\ngranted a gratuity calculated on the following formula:\n\n1/48 x salary x 12 x period of reckonable service not\nexceeding 72 months.\n\n(2) The gratuity payable under this paragraph shall\nbe based on the highest drawn salary and the period of\nreckonable service of the Member of the Administration\nwho is a Member of the House of Representatives at the\ntime of dissolution of Parliament.\n\n1487                 P.U. (A) 128-129.\n\n(3) Any gratuity that had been paid to the Member\nof the Administration who is a Member of the House of\nRepresentatives upon dissolution of Parliament shall be\ndeducted from the gratuity that falls due to be paid under\nthis paragraph.\".\n\nMade 14 March 1996.\n[JPA/PEN (R) 228/26/6-12; PN. (PU?) 369/III.]\nBy Command,\n\nTan Sri Dato' Seri AHMAD Sari BIN ABDUL HAMID,\nSecretary to the Cabinet\n\nP.U. (A) 129.\nAKTA CUKAI PENDAPATAN 1967\n\nPERINTAH CUKAI Pendapatan (PENGECUALIAN) (No. 31) 1995\nPEMBETULAN\n\nDALAM teks bahasa Inggeris kepada P.U. (A) 450 yang disiarkan\npada 28 Disember 1995, gantikan perkataan \"for\" yang terdapat\ndalam perenggan pertama dengan perkataan \"from\".\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\nIncome Tax (Exemption) (No, 31) Order 1995\n\nCORRIGENDUM\n\nIn the English language text to P.U. (A) 450 published on 28 December\n1995, substitute for the word \"for\" appearing in the first paragraph\nthe word \"from\".\n\n[Perb. CR. (8.09) 681/2-61 (SJ. 18); PN. (PU?) 80/XXII; JHDN.\n01/35/(S)/42/51/259-14.]\n\nDICETAK OLEH\n\nA} PERCETAKAN NASIONAL MALAYSIA BERHAD,\n\nIBU PEJABAT, KUALA LUMPUR\n\nBAGI PIHAK DAN DENGAN PERINTAH KERAJAAN MALAYSIA"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
