     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Declaration of Bodies\n\nCorporate) (Johor Corporation) Order 2012.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 7 May 2012.\n\nDeclaration of application of the Act"
