     "en": "2. The body corporate known as Johor Corporation is declared to be a body\n\ncorporate to which the Act applies.\n\nMade 2 May 2012\n\n[KK/BPKA/M/(S)/689/1/1; PN(PU2)232/VII]\n\n DATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n\n Second Minister of Finance"
