    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Co-operative Societies (Assumption of\nControl) Order 2012.\n\n(2) This order shal l have effect from 16 Janu ary 2012  for a period of not\nexceeding two years.\n\nAssumption of control"
    }
