 "MY-H1137": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1137",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1)  This order may be cited as the Capital Markets and Services\n(Prescription of Securities) (Digital Currency and Digital Token) Order 2019.\n\n(2)  This Order comes into operation on 15 January 2019.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order—\n\n\"digital currency\" means a digital representation of value which is recorded on a\ndistributed digital ledger whether cryptographically -secured or otherwise, that\nfunctions as a medium of exchange and is interchangeable with any money,\nincluding through the crediting or debiting of an account; and\n\n\"digital token\" means a digital representation which is recorded on a distributed\ndigital ledger whether cryptographically-secured or otherwise.\n\nDigital currency and digital token are prescribed to be securities"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) A digital currency which—\n\n(a) is tra ded in a place or on a facility  where offers to sell, purchase ,\nor exchange of, the digital currency are regularly made or accepted;\n\n(b) a person expects a return in any form from  the trading, conversion\nor redemption of the digital currency or the appreciation in the\nvalue of the digital currency; and\n\n(c) is not issued or guaranteed by any government body or central\nbanks as may be specified by the Commission,\n\nis prescribed as securities for the purposes of the securities laws.\n\n(2) A digital token  which represents a right or interest of a person in any\narrangement made for the purpose  of, or having the effect of, providing facilities for the\nperson, where—\n\n(a) the person receives the digital token in exchange for a\nconsideration;\n\n(b) the consideration or contribution from the person, and the income\nor returns, are pooled;\n\n(c) the income or returns of the arrangement are generated from the\nacquisition, holding , management or disposal of any property or\nassets or business activities;\n\n(d) the person expects a return in any form from the trading,\nconversion or redemption of the digital token or the appreciation in\nthe value of the digital token;\n\n(e) the person does not have day-to-day control over the management\nof the property, assets or business of the arrangement; and\n\n(f) the digital token is not issued or guaranteed by any government\nbody or central banks as may be specified by the Commission,\n\nis prescribed as securities for the purposes of the securities laws.\n\nApplication of requirements under securities laws"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. The provisions of securities laws shall apply to a digital currency and digital token\nthat are prescribed as securities under this Order except for Division 3 of Part VI o f\nthe Act.\n\nDigital currency and digital token are not share, etc."
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "5. For the purpose of securities laws , a digital currency and digital token that are\nprescribed as securities under this Order that is offered  or traded  on or through a\nrecognized market is not—\n\n(a) a share in or debenture of, a body corporate or an unincorporated body; or\n\n(b) a unit in a unit trust scheme or prescribed investments scheme.\n\nMade 8 January 2019\n[KK/SID/(S)/483/669/4 JLD. 2 (SK.12); GC(LR)1/2018(263)-1 DIGITAL ASSETS;\nPN(PU2)662/XIV]\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMinister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H1141": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1141",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Excise Duties (Payment of\nPremix Preparation) Order 2024.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 March 2024.\n\nExcise duty"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Subject to subparagraph (2), the rate of excise duty specified in column (5)\nof the Schedule to the Excise Duties  Order 2022 [P.U. (A) 163/2022 ] shall be levied\nand paid by the licensed manufacturer and licensee.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Order, the goods described in column (3)\nof the Schedule to the Excise Duties  Order 2022 in relation to  heading 18.06\nin Chapter 18, heading 19.01 in Chapter 19 and, headings 21.01 and 21.06 in Chapter 21\nshall be referred to as \"premix preparation\".\n\nMethod of payment"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) The licensed manufacturer or licensee who removes the premix\npreparation from the place licensed  or licensed warehouse f or con sumption within\nMalaysia shall pay the excise duty not later than the last day of the following month\nfrom the removal of the premix preparation.\n\n (2) The Direct or General may allow  a security to be given\nby the licensed manufacturer or licensee for the payment of  excise duty\nreferred to in subparagraph (1).\n\n(3) The security given by the licensed manufacturer or licensee\nunder subparagraph (2) shall become payable provided that—\n\n(a) the licensed manufacturer or licensee is liable for the excise duty\nreferred to in subparagraph (1) at all times; and\n\n(b) the Director General may demand payment of the excise duty\nreferred to in subparagraph (1) from the licensed manufacturer\nor licensee if the Director General has reason to believe that\nthe premix preparation is not accounted for.\n\n(4) In this paragraph, \"place licensed\" means any place of manufacture relating\nto premix preparation as specified in the licence issued to the licensed manufacturer.\n\nRevocation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. The Excise Duties (Premix Preparation) (Payment) Order 2022\n[P.U. (A) 290/2022] is revoked.\n\nMade 15 January 2024\n[Sulit KE.HT (96)669/19-8 Klt.3 SK.27; MOF.TAX(S) 700-2/1/16 JLD.13; PN(PU2)337/JLD.28]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 6(2) of the Excise Act 1976]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
