     "en": "2. The Commission  has reappointed Messrs. Jamal, Amin & Partners\n(Registration No. AF1067) to assume control of the whole of the property, business,\nactivities and affairs of the Koperasi Belia Nasional Berhad and carry on the whole of its\nbusiness, activities and affairs with effect from 31 October 2018 to 30 October 2019.\n\nCosts and expenses"
