 "MY-H1160": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1160",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Income Tax (Deduction for Payment of\nPremium to Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation) Rules 2013.\n\n(2) These Rules are deemed to have effect from the year of assessment 2005\nuntil the year of assessment 2010 for a financial institution provided in paragraph\n36(1)(a) of the Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation Act 2011 [Act 720].\n\n(3) These Rules are deemed to have effect  from the year of assessment 2011\nand subsequent years of assessment for a financial institution provided in subsection\n36(1) and a takaful operator or an insurance company provided in subsection 36(2) of\nthe Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation Act 2011.\n\nApplication"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. These Rules apply to a member institution specified in subsections 36(1) and (2)\nof the Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation Act 2011.\n\nDeduction"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) For the purpose of ascertaining the adjusted income of a member\ninstitution from its business for a basic period for a year of assessment, there shall be\nallowed a deduction of an amount equivalent to the first premium or annual premium\npaid by that member institution to the Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporatio n for that\nyear of assessment.\n\n (2) For the purpose of subrule (1), the amount of deduction for premium paid\nshall be as determined under—\n\n(a) sections 42, 43 and 44 of the Malaysia Deposit Insurance\nCorporation Act 2005  [Act 642 ] in respect of a member inst itution\nunder paragraph 36(1) (a) of the Malaysia Deposit Insurance\nCorporation Act 2011; or\n\n(b) sections 47, 48 and 49 or sections 71, 72 and 73 of the Malaysia\nDeposit Insurance Corporation Act 2011 in respect of a member\ninstitution under subsections 36(1) and (2) of the Malaysia Deposit\nInsurance Corporation Act 2011.\n\nRevocation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. The Income Tax (Deduction for Payment of Premium to Malaysia Deposit\nInsurance Corporation) Rules 2011 [P.U. (A) 379/2011] are revoked.\n\nMade 22 March 2013\n[KK/BUU/(S)10/0.474 SJ.1 JLD.15; LHDN. 01/35/(S)/42/51/286-39; PN(PU2)80/LXIX]\n\n                    DATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n       Second Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 154(2) of the Income Tax Act 1967]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
