    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Determination of Maximum Price) (No. 2) Order 2016.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 23 May 2016 to 1 June 2016.\n\nMaximum producer price"
    }
