     "en": "2. The First Schedule to the Act is amended in Part I—\n\n (a) by substituting for the full stop at the end of paragraph (p) a semicolon;\n\nand\n\n (b) by inserting after paragraph (p) the following paragraph:\n\n \"(q) the final examination of the Universiti Sultan Zainal Abidin for the\n\nDegree of Bachelor of Accounting (Honours).\".\n\nMade 1 March 2013\n\n[Perb. KK/BP/PSM/10/523/3/1-2013; PN(PU2)229/III]\n\nDATO' SERI HAJI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n\n Second Minister of Finance"
