    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Paragraph 13(2)(a) of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting\nfor the word \"fifty\" the word \"twenty\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 23"
    }
