 "MY-H1365": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1365",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (West Malaysia)\n\n(Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2021.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 31 March 2021.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989], which is\n\nreferred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended in the First Schedule—\n\n(a) under the heading of \"Pulau Pinang\"—\n\n(i) by substituting for item 1 the following item:\n\n\"1. (Route 1): Butterworth - Sungai Petani Road\n\nFrom coordinates N. 5.383031, E. 100.38742 and ending at\n\nKedah/Penang boundary at coordinates N 5.565121, E 100.428937\n\nwithin the boundaries of right of way as shown on\n\nMAP 4: BUTTERWORTH-SUNGAI PETANI ROAD (a distance\n\nof 23.080 km).\";\n\n(ii) by substituting for item 2 the following item:\n\n\"2. (Route 1): Butterworth – Ipoh Road\n\nFrom coordinates N 5.130583, E 100.473543 and ending at\n\ncoordinates N 5.378478, E 100.401280 within the boundaries of\n\nright of way as shown on MAP 5 : BUTTERWORTH-IPOH ROAD\n\n(a distance of 33.700 km).\";\n\n(iii) by substituting for item 3 the following item:\n\n\"3. (Route 6): Around Penang Island Road\n\nFrom coordinates N 5.443000, E 100.305000 and ending at\n\ncoordinates N 5.379000, E 100.308000 within the boundaries of\n\nright of way as shown on MAP 6 : AROUND PENANG ISLAND ROAD\n\n(a distance of 60.040 km).\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after MAP 3 : FEDERAL ROADS OF PULAU PINANG the\n\nfollowing maps:\n\n\"MAP 4: BUTTERWORTH-SUNGAI PETANI ROAD\n\nMAP 5 : BUTTERWORTH- IPOH ROAD\n\nMAP 6 : AROUND PENANG ISLAND ROAD\n\n\".\n\nAmendment of Fourth Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Fourth Schedule to the principal Order is amended under the heading\n\n\"Pulau Pinang\"—\n\n(a) by substituting for item 1 the following item:\n\n\"1. (Laluan 3113): Coastal Road (Bayan Lepas Highway)\n\nFrom coordinates N 5.289036, E 100.289096 and ending at\n\ncoordinates N 5.350996, E 100.309589 within the boundaries of\n\nright of way as shown on MAP 2: COASTAL ROAD (BAYAN LEPAS\n\nHIGHWAY) (a distance of 12.180 km).\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after MAP 1: ROUTE 3114 - KG. JAWA HIGHWAY\n\nthe following map:\n\n\"MAP 2: COASTAL ROAD (BAYAN LEPAS HIGHWAY)\n\n\".\n\nMade 23 March 2021\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/5; PN(PU2)391/Jld.40]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nSenior Minister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
