 "MY-H1379": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1379",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Fees (Employment Pass, Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary Employment) and Work Pass) (Remission of Fees) Order 2020.\n\nRemission of fees"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The fees payable under paragraphs 3 and 3A of the Fees (Employment Pass,\n\nVisit Pass (Temporary Employment) and Work Pass) Order 1998 [P.U. (A) 479/1998]\n\nfor a Visit Pass (Temporary Employment) which expires on any date from 1 April 2020\n\nto 31 December 2020 are remitted by twenty-five percent.\n\n(2) The fees remitted under subregulation (1) shall not include processing\n\nfees.\n\n(3) The remission of fees under subparagraph (1) shall not apply to—\n\n(a) a new Visit Pass (Temporary Employment) issued\n\nwithin the period from 1 April 2020 to 31 December 2020; and\n\n(b) a Visit Pass (Temporary Employment) for a domestic maid.\n\nMade 28 April 2020\n\n[KDN:IM.S.600-4/1/22 JLD. 16(36); PN(PU2)86/XVII]\n\n By Command\n\nDATUK SERI MOHD ZUKI BIN ALI\n\nSecretary to the Cabinet"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
