 "MY-H1409": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1409",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Income Tax (Exemption) (No. 4 )\nOrder 2019.\n\n (2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 1 March 2019.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1)  The Minister exempts a person not resident in Malaysia  from the\npayment of income tax in respect of income derived from Malaysia in relation to any\namount of payment for shrink -wrapped software, site -license, downloadable software\nor software bundled with p ersonal computer hardware, smartphone or tablet received\nfrom an end user who shall be an individual resident in Malaysia who purchases\nsoftware or acquires any right to use software for personal usage and not for usage in\nhis business.\n\n(2) Nothing in subparagraph (1) shall absolve or be deemed to have\nabsolved the person from complying with any requirement to submit any return or\nstatement of accounts or to furnish any other information under the provisions\nof the Act.\n\nNon-application"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Section 109 of the Act shall not apply to the income exempted under this Order.\n\nMade 21 May 2019\n[Perb. CR(8.09)681/2-61(SJ.18)JLD.14(SK.9); LHDN.AYA.600-12/1/7(29)-10;\nPN(PU2)80/XCIV]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMinister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Raky at pursuant to subsection 127(4) of the\nIncome Tax Act 1967]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
