 "MY-H1425": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1425",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the National Speed Limit\n\n(Temporary Cessation) (No. 2) Order 2019.\n\n(2) This Order has effect from 29 May 2019 to 12 June 2019.\n\nTemporary cessation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Subparagraph 2(1) of the National Speed Limit Order 1989\n\n[P.U. (A) 18/1989] which provides the speed limit of ninety (90) kilometres per hour for\n\nall roads in Malaysia, other than the roads described in the Schedule to the National\n\nSpeed Limit Order 1989, shall cease to have effect for the period from 29 May 2019\n\nto 12 June 2019.\n\n(2) Upon the expiry of this Order, subparagraph 2(1) of the National Speed\n\nLimit Order 1989 shall have effect as if this Order had not been made.\n\nMade 28 May 2019\n\n[KP/BD/PJ/0.139 Jld.6(28); PN(PU2)460/CII]\n\nLOKE SIEW FOOK\n\nMinister of Transport"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
