     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Compounding of Offences) (Amendment) (No. 6)\n\nRegulations 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 13 May 2020.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
