 "MY-H1427": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1427",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Prevention and Control of Infectious\n\nDiseases (Declaration of Infected Local Areas) (Extension of Operation)\n\nOrder 2021.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 April 2021.\n\nExtension of operation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The operation of the Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases\n\n(Declaration of Infected Local Areas) Order 2020 [P.U. (A) 87/2020] which had been\n\nextended for the period from 1 January 2021 to 31 March 2021 by the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Declaration of Infected Local Areas)\n\n(Extension of Operation) (No. 7) Order 2020 [P.U. (A) 399/2020] is further extended\n\nfor a period from 1 April 2021 to 1 August 2021.\n\nMade 30 March 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Minister of Health"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H1428": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1428",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the National Skills Development\n\n(Advertisement) Regulations 2022.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 May 2022.\n\nParticulars of advertisement on accredited centre or accredited programme"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Every advertisement on an accredited centre or accredited programme by a\n\nskills training provider shall contain the following particulars:\n\n(a) the name of the company and company registration number of the\n\nskills training provider;\n\n(b) the code of the accredited centre issued by the Director General to the\n\nskills training provider;\n\n(c) the name and code of the accredited programme issued by the\n\nDirector General;\n\n(d) the address of the premise, telephone number and e-mail address of the\n\naccredited centre; and\n\n(e) any other information determined by the Director General as published\n\nin the official website of the Department of Skills Development,\n\nMinistry of Human Resources.\n\nLanguage"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) Every advertisement on an accredited centre or accredited programme\n\nby a skills training provider shall be in the national language.\n\n(2) In addition to the national language, any other languages may be used\n\nin the advertisement on an accredited centre or accredited programme by a\n\nskills training provider.\n\nFont size of the words \"Department of Skills Development\""
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Where the words \"Department of Skills Development\" are used in the\n\nadvertisement on an accredited centre or accredited programme by a skills training\n\nprovider, the size of the fonts of such words shall be half of the size of the fonts used\n\nfor the name of the accredited centre.\n\nOffence"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "5. Any person who contravenes any provision of these Regulations commits\n\nan offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit\n\nor to imprisonment not exceeding one year or to both.\n\nMade 28 April 2022\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/2/16/2 (20); PN(PU2)655/JLD. 6]\n\nDATUK SERI SARAVANAN A/L MURUGAN\n\nMinistry of Human Resources"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
