 "MY-H1441": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1441",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Local Speed Limit (Federal Roads)\n\n(Specified Time Prohibition) (No. 2) Order 2019.\n\n(2) This Order has effect from 29 May 2019 to 12 June 2019.\n\nProhibition"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The driving of motor vehicles at a speed greater than eighty (80) kilometres\n\nper hour over all Federal roads in Malaysia, other than the roads specified in the\n\nFirst Schedule to the Local Speed Limit (Federal Roads) (West Malaysia) Order 1992\n\n[P.U. (A) 462/1991], is prohibited.\n\n(2) The prohibition in subparagraph (1) shall cease to have effect upon the\n\nexpiry of this Order.\n\nMade 27 May 2019\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/8/1 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/CII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMinister of Works"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H1442": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1442",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Service Tax (Amendment)\nRegulations 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 14 May 2020.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Service Tax Regulations 2018 [ P.U. (A) 2 14/2018] is amended\nin the First Schedule—\n(a) in paragraph (3), by substituting for the words \" (h) or (i)\"  the words\n\"(h), (i) or (l)\";\n(b) by substituting paragraph 3A with the following paragraph:\n \"3A.  Where a company in a group of companies acquires any taxable service\nspecified in item (a), (b), (c), (d), (e), (f), (g), (h), (i)  or (l)  in  column (2)\nin Group G from any company other than foreign registered person\nwithin the same group of companies outside Malaysia, such service\nshall not be an imported taxable service.\"; and\n(c)  in Group G, in column (2)—\n(i) by substituting item (l) with the following item:\n\"(l)  Provision of digital services including provision of electronic\nmedium that allows the suppliers to provide supplies to customers\n\nor transaction for provision of digital services on behalf of\nany person, excluding provision of such services in relatio n\nto matters outside Malaysia.\"; and\n\n(ii) by deleting item (m).\n\nMade13 May 2020\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/2/27; PN(PU2)752/IV]\n\nTENGKU DATO' SRI ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
