 "MY-H1493": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1493",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) (No. 2)\n\nOrder 2025.\n\n(2) This Order has effect for the period from 13 May 2025 to 13 February 2026.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Subject to paragraph 3, the Minister exempts Ancom Crop Care Sdn. Bhd.\n\n(Company Registration Number: 198501015714 (148170-X)) in relation to a pesticide\n\ncontaining Tebuthiuron as its active ingredient from—\n\n(a) the requirement to register the pesticide under section 7 of the Act;\n\n(b) the prohibition under paragraph 13(1)(b) of the Act for the purpose of\n\nimportation of the pesticide; and\n\n(c) the requirement for a license to sell or store the pesticide for sale under\n\nsection 17 of the Act.\n\nConditions of exemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a) Ancom Crop Care Sdn. Bhd. is allowed to import 300 tonnes\n\nof the pesticide and all such amount of pesticide shall subsequently\n\nbe exported;\n\n(b) Ancom Crop Care Sdn. Bhd. shall submit one copy of purchase order\n\nof the pesticide to the Board each time before the importation of\n\nthe pesticide is carried out;\n\n(c) Ancom Crop Care Sdn. Bhd. shall submit a report in respect of\n\nthe imports and exports of the pesticide to the Board every month; and\n\n(d) the report referred to in subsubparagraph (c) shall disclose\n\nthe amount of the pesticide which has been imported and exported\n\nby Ancom Crop Care Sdn. Bhd..\n\n(2) The Minister may revoke the exemption under paragraph 2 if any condition\n\nunder subparagraph (1) is not complied with.\n\nMade 8 May 2025\n\n[KP/LA/8/11; PN(PU2)275/JLD.24]\n\nDATUK SERI HAJI MOHAMAD BIN SABU\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Food Security"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
