 "MY-H1543": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1543",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies\nCorporate) (Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) Order 2011.\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 5 May 2011.\nRemission of Tax"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Any tax payable under the Income Tax 1967 Act [Act 53] shall be remitted in\nfull in respect of the Facility Agreement to be made between Jambatan Kedua Sdn.\nBhd. (the \"Borrower\") and AmIslamic Bank Berhad (the \"Lender\") in relation to the\nprovision of a term loan facility (the \"Facility\") of up to the aggregate amount of six\nhundred million ringgit (RM600,000,000.00) to the Borrower, which is payable\nby―\n(a) the Borrower, to which this Act applies by virtue of the Loans\nGuarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate) ( Jambatan Kedua Sdn.\nBhd.) Order 2009 [P.U. (A) 29/2009];\n(b) the Government of Malaysia under a guarantee to be provided by the\nGovernment of Malaysia pursuant to the Facility; and\n(c) any other party to the Facility Agreement  including any transferee\nor assignee thereto.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378] in respect of\nthe Facility Agreement shall be remitted in full.\nMade 29 April 2011\n[KK/BPKA/M3/(S)/168/1/2 Jld. 2; PN(PU2) 232/VII]\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
