     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Determination of Maximum Price and Price Marking of Price -Controlled Goods)\n(No. 3) Order 2012.\n(2) This Order has effect for the period from 27 May 2012 to 2 June 2012.\nMaximum producer price"
