     "en": "2. Customs (Definitive Safeguards Duties) Order 2017  [P.U. (A) 12 2/2017]\nis amended in the Schedule—\n\n(a) by substituting for subheading \"7214.30.00 10\" subheading\n\"7214.30.10 00\"; and\n\n(b) by substitu ting for subheading \"7214.30.00 9 0\" subheading\n\"7214.30.90 00\".\n\nMade 26 May 2017\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/40 Sk.6/Perb. 0.9060/18 (SJ.30); PN(PU2)647/VI]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"
