    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Local Speed Limit (Federal Roads)\n\n(Sarawak) (Amendment) Order 2022.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 15 May 2022.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    }
