    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The maximum producer price for the price -controlled goods specified\nin column (1) of the First Schedule for the State of Sabah  and the Federal Territory\nof Labuan is determined according to districts and area as specified in column (2).\n\nMaximum wholesale price"
    }
