     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] is amended\n\nin the First Schedule under the heading \"Negeri Selangor Darul Ehsan\"—\n\n(a) by inserting after item 54 the following item:\n\n\"55. (Route 28): Cheras Elevated U–Turn\n\nStarting from the entrance to Route 28 at Cheras Roundabout\n\nat coordinates N 3.098356, E 101.737416 and ending at Route 28\n\nat coordinates N 3.099676, E 101.737488 as shown on\n\nMap 26 : CHERAS ELEVATED U-TURN, NEGERI SELANGOR\n\n(a distance of 0.723 km).\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after MAP 25: RAWANG BYPASS ROAD, NEGERI SELANGOR\n\nthe following map:\n\n\".\n\n\"MAP 26: CHERAS ELEVATED U-TURN, NEGERI SELANGOR\n\nMade 9 July 2018\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/1 Jld.4; PN(PU2)391/XXXV]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMinister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]"
