    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Minister exempts the admission ticket for the 王赫野【声生不息】海外限定\n\n演唱会-吉隆坡站 show which was held at Bukit Jalil Axiata Arena, Kuala Lumpur\n\non 24 January 2026 from entertainments duty.\n\nMade 18 March 2026\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/35; PN(PU2)174/JLD.14]\n\n DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\n\n Finance Minister II"
    }
