 "MY-H1681": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1681",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guara ntee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) Order 2012.\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 30 May 2012.\nRemission of Tax"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53] shall be remitted in full\nin respect of any money payable under any agreement, note, instrument or document in\nrelation to any of the Islamic Medium Term Notes issued pursuant to the Islamic\nMedium Term Notes Programme in nominal value of three thousand five hundred\nmillion ringgit (RM3,500,000,000.00) (\"the IMTN Programme\") by Perbadanan Tabung\nPendidikan Tinggi Nasional (\" the Issuer\") including but not limited to any agreement,\nnote, instrument and document in relation to the guarantee (\" the Guarantee\") provided\nor to be provided by the Government of Malaysia, which is payable by—\n(a) the Issuer, to which this Act applies by virtue of the Loans Guarantee\n(Declaration of Bodies Corporate) (Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan\nTinggi Nasional) Order 2004 [P.U. (A) 408/2004];\n(b) any holder of the Islamic Medium Term Notes; or\n(c) any other party to any agreement, note, instrument and document in\nrelation to the Islamic Medium Term Notes, the IMTN Programme or the\nGuarantee, including any party to whom such agreement, note,\ninstrument and document is transferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument and document in relation to the Islamic Medium Term\nNotes, the IMTN Programme or the Guarantee shall be remitted in full.\nMade 28 May 2012\n[KK/BPKA/M5/(S)/513/16 JLD.6; PN(PU2)232/VII]\nDATO' SERI HAJI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
