    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Employees Provident Fund (Amendment\n\nof Third Schedule) Order 2003.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 June 2003 and shall be in operation\n\nuntil 31 May 2004.\n\nAMAUN UPAH BAGI KADAR CARUMAN BAGI\n\nBULAN ITU BULAN ITU\n\nOleh Oleh Jumlah\n\nMajikan Pekerja Caruman\n\nRM RM RM RM RM\n\nP.U. (A) 171.\n\nAmendment of Third Schedule"
    }
