 "MY-H1858": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1858",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Motor Vehicles (Periodic Inspection,\n\nEquipment and Inspection Standard) (Amendment) Rules 2024.\n\n(2) These Rules come into operation on 1 July 2024.\n\nAmendmend of rule 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Motor Vehicles (Periodic Inspection, Equipment and Inspection Standard)\n\nRules 1995 [P.U. (A) 49/1995], which are referred to as the \"principal Rules\"\n\nin these Rules, are amended in rule 4—\n\n(a) in subparagraph (a)(i), by inserting after the words \"container's trailer\"\n\nthe words \"and container's semi-trailer\";\n\n(b) in subparagraph (a)(ii), by deleting the word \"and\" at the end of\n\nthe subparagraph;\n\n(c) in subparagraph (a)(iii), by substituting for the semi-colon at the end of\n\nthe subparagraph the words \"; and\";\n\n(d) by inserting after subparagraph (a)(iii) the following subparagraph:\n\n\"(iv) the category of driving school vehicle;\";\n\n(e) by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph:\n\n\"(b) for a newly manufactured container's trailer and container's\n\nsemi-trailer, once in every twelve months for the first ten years and\n\nthereafter once in every six months;\";\n\n(f) in paragraph (d), by deleting the word \"and\" at the end of the paragraph;\n\nand\n\n(g) by inserting after paragraph (d) the following paragraph:\n\n\"(da) for the category of driving school vehicle which have reached\n\nthe age of three years from the registration date of the vehicle\n\nunder section 7 of the Act, once in every twelve months for\n\nthe first ten years and thereafter once in every six months; and\".\n\nTransitional"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any category of driving school vehicle which have reached the age of three years\n\nfrom the registration dates of the vehicles under section 7 of the Act shall, at any time\n\nwithin the period of six months from the date of coming into operation of these Rules,\n\nundergo periodic inspection in accordance with the principal Rules as amended\n\nby these Rules.\n\nMade 27 June 2024\n\n[MOT.BD.(S)600-1/3/2(17); PN(PU2)460/JLD.133]\n\nLOKE SIEW FOOK\n\nMinister of Transport"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
