 "MY-H1880": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1880",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Price Marking of Price-Controlled Goods) (No. 4) Order 2016.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 16 June 2016 to 6 July 2016.\n\nPrice marking"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Any person who sells or offers to sell any price -controlled goods\npublished in the Price Control and Anti-Profiteering (Determination of Maximum Price)\n(No. 4) Order 2016 [P.U. (A) 174/2016] shall affix a pink coloured label indicating the\nprice per unit or per unit weight, the name describing such price-controlled goods and\nthe grade or quality, if any, of such price-controlled goods.\n\n (2) Any person who fails to comply with subparagraph (1) commits an\noffence and shall, on conviction, be liable—\n\n(a) if such person is a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding twenty\nthousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence, to a fine\nnot exceeding fifty thousand ringgit; or\n\n(b) if such person is not a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding ten\nthousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence, to a fine\nnot exceeding twenty thousand ringgit.\n\nMade 15 June 2016\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\nMinister of Domestic Trade,\nCo-operatives and Consumerism"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
