    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Customs (Anti -Dumping Duties)  (No. 3 ) Order 2020 [P.U. (A) 348/2020]\nis amended in subparagraph 4(1) by substituting for the words \"Customs Duties\nOrder 2017 [P.U. (A) 5/2017]\" the words \"Customs Duties Order 2022 [P.U. (A) 114/2022]\".\n\nMade 30 May 2022\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249 Klt.11 Sk. 7; MOF.TAX(S)700-2/1/55 JLD. 3; PN(PU2)338D/Jld. 6]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n                                 Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"
    }
