 "MY-H1937": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1937",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Entertainments Duty (Exemption) (No. 16)\n\nOrder 2025.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Minister exempts sixty per cent from the entertainments duty payable on\n\nthe admission ticket for the screening of the movies specified in the Schedule which were\n\nscreened at the Golden Screen Cinemas (GSC), Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur\n\nfrom 1 January 2024 to 31 December 2024."
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H1938": {
  "lawId": "MY-H1938",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. These rules may be cited as the Lembaga Kemajuan Ikan Malaysia\n\n(Fisheries Complexes, Fisheries Harbours and Fisheries Landing Jetties)\n\n(Amendment) Rules 2026.\n\nSubstitution of rule 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Lembaga Kemajuan Ikan Malaysia (Fisheries Complexes, Fisheries Harbours\n\nand Fisheries Landing Jetties) Rules 2010 [P.U. (A) 103/2010], which are referred\n\nto as the \"principal Rules\" in these Rules, are amended by substituting for rule 3\n\nthe following rule:\n\n\"Fisheries complex and fisheries harbour"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Lembaga may declare any place or area as fisheries complex or\n\nfisheries harbour.\".\n\nAmendment of rule 8\n\n3. Rule 8 of the principal Rules is amended by substituting for subrule (1)\n\nthe following subrule:\n\n\"(1) Any person operating any private fisheries landing jetty shall\n\nobtain consent of the Lembaga and the Lembaga may declare such private\n\nfisheries landing jetty as a fisheries landing jetty under these Rules.\".\n\nAmendment of Second Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. The Second Schedule to the principal Rules is amended in Part III—\n\n(a) in the national language text, in column Caj Perkhidmatan, in\n\nsubitem (a)(iii), by deleting the words \"tidak melebihi\";\n\n(b) in the national language text, in column Caj Perkhidmatan, in\n\nsubitem (b)(iii), by deleting the words \"tidak melebihi\";\n\n(c) in the English language text, in column Description, in subitem (a)(i),\n\nby substituting for the word \"recepticle\" the word \"receptacle\";\n\n(d) in the English language text, in column Description, in subitem (b)(i),\n\nby substituting for the word \"recepticle\" the word \"receptacle\"; and\n\n(e) in the English language text, in column Description, in subitem (c)(i),\n\nby substituting for the word \"recepticle\" the word \"receptacle\".\n\nMade 19 January 2026\n\n[KP/LA/8/4; PN(PU2)275/JLD.24]\n\n TUAN HAJI MUHAMMAD FAIZ BIN DATO' HAJI FADZIL\n\nChairman\n\nLembaga Kemajuan Ikan Malaysia\n\nApproved 6 April 2026\n\n[KP/LA/8/4; PN(PU2)275/JLD.24]\n\n DATUK SERI HAJI MOHAMAD BIN SABU\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Food Security"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
