     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Determination of Maximum Price) (No. 2) Order 2021.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 21 April 2021 to 20 May 2021.\n\nMaximum producer price"
