     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Stamp Duty)(No. 2) Order 2012.\n(2) This Orderis deemed to havecome into operation on 27 March 2012.\nRemission of stamp duty"
