 "MY-H2083": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2083",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order  may be cited as the Malaysian Aviation Commission\n(Individual Exemption) (Transpacific Joint Venture Agreement between All Nippon\nAirways Co., Ltd. and United Airlines, Ltd.) Order 2018.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 11 May 2017 to 10 May 2022.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order—\n\n\"Joint Venture Agreement \" means the Transpacific Joint V enture Agreement\nbetween All Nippon Airways Co., Ltd. and United Airlines, Ltd. dated 7 May 2012;\n\n\"party\" means a party to the Joint Venture Agreement, individually referring to All\nNippon Airways Co. , Ltd. or United Airlines, Ltd. , and \" parties\" shall be\nconstrued accordingly.\n\nIndividual exemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Commission grants an individual exemption in respect of  the\nJoint Venture Agreement from the prohibition under section 49 of the Act.\n\nConditions of the individual exemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. The individual exemption gra nted under this Order is subject to the\nfollowing conditions:\n\n(a) the parties shall not operate under a common name; and\n\n(b) the Joint Venture Agreement shall not restrict either party to enter into any\nother agreements with another enterprise.\n\nObligations under the individual exemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "5. (1) Where any variation or amendment is made to the Joint Venture\nAgreement, either party shall file such variation or amendment in writing with  the\nCommission within two weeks from the date of the making of the variation\nor amendment.\n\n(2) Upon request by the Commission, the parties shall make available to the\nCommission any document or information relating to the aviation services or other\nservices provided by the parties under the Joint Venture Agreement  in such form and\nmanner and within such period, as determined by the Commission.\n\nMade 2 August 2018\n[MOT.BU(S).600-2/17/1 Jld.6(43); PN(PU2)735/II]\n\nDR. NUNGSARI AHMAD RADHI\nExecutive Chairman\nMalaysian Aviation Commission"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
