     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] is amended\n\nin the First Schedule under the heading of \"Negeri Kedah Darul Aman\"\n\n(a) by substituting for item 27 the following item:\n\n\"(27). (Route 136): Kuala Ketil-Merbau Pulas-Lunas-Pekan Bandar Baharu\n\nRoad\n\nFrom its junction with Route 67 at coordinates N 620755.038,\n\nE 294956.973 and ending at Pekan Bandar Baharu at coordinates\n\nN 567905.037, E 278696.127 as shown on Map: Kuala Ketil\u0002Merbau Pulas-Lunas-Pekan Bandar Baharu Road, Negeri Kedah.\n\nA distance of 81.44 km.\"; and\n\n(b) by substituting for \"MAP 1: NEGERI KEDAH DARUL AMAN\" the following\n\nmap:\n\n\"MAP: KUALA KETIL-MERBAU PULAS-LUNAS-PEKAN BANDAR BAHARU ROAD, NEGERI\n\nKEDAH\n\n.\"\n\nMade 2 June 2011\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/4; PN(PU2)391/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SHAZIMAN BIN ABU MANSOR\n\nMinister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat under section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]"
