     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Motor Vehicles (Periodic Inspection,\n\nEquipment and Inspection Standard) (Amendment) Rules 2019.\n\n(2) These Rules come into operation on 15 July 2019.\n\nSubstitution of rule 4"
