     "en": "2. Motor Vehicles (Periodic Inspection, Equipment and Inspection Standard)\n\nRules 1995 [P. U. (A) 49/1995], which is referred to as the \"principal Rules\" in these Rules,\n\nare amended by substituting for rule 4 the following rule:"
