    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Sales Tax (Exemption) Order 2008 [ P.U. (A) 91/2008 ] is amended in\nSchedule B, in relation to item 78, in column (2) by substituting for paragraph (iv) the\nfollowing paragraph:\n\n\"(iv) Bredero Shaw (Malaysia) Sdn. Berh ad (formerly known as Bredero Price\n(Malaysia) Sdn. Bhd.);\".\n\nMade 18 June 2012\n[7SULIT KE.HT(96)669/13-66 SK.23; Perb. 0.9060/18 Jld.28 (SK.6); PN(PU2)102/XVII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    }
