    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (Private Management) (Collection of Tolls) (Damansara–\n\nPuchong Highway) Order 1999 [P.U. (A) 27/1999] is amended in the First Schedule in\n\nthe heading, by substituting for the words \"31 AUGUST 2015\" the\n\nwords \"31 DECEMBER 2015\".\n\nMade 26 August 2015\n\n[KKR/PUU.110-1/7/6; PN(PU2)426/LIX]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works"
    }
