     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Water Services Industry\n(Water Supply Servi ces Agreement B etween Consumer And\nWater Distribution Licensee) (Amendment of Schedule) Rules 2020.\n\n(2) These Rules come into operation on 1 July 2020.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
