    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] is amended in\n\nthe First Schedule—\n\n(b) under the heading \"Negeri Pahang Darul Makmur\"—\n\n(i) by inserting after item 46 the following item:\n\n\"47. (Route 438): Cherok Paloh Road\n\nFrom its junction with Route 230, Kuantan-Cherok Paloh Road at\n\ncoordinates N 3.611623, E 103.380239 and ending at coordinates\n\nN 3.601046, E 103.402078 within boundaries of right of way as\n\nshown on MAP 25: CHEROK PALOH ROAD, NEGERI PAHANG\n\n(a distance of 2.928 km).\"; and\n\n(ii) by inserting after MAP 24: JALAN CENTRAL SPINE, NEGERI PAHANG\n\nthe following map:\n\n \"; and\n\n \"MAP 25: CHEROK PALOH ROAD, NEGERI PAHANG\n\nMade\n\n(a)\n\nSouth China Sea\n\nKem PLKN Semarak\n\nN 3.611623\n\nE 103.380239\n\nCherok Paloh\n\nSungai Pahang\n\nDISTRICT OF KUANTAN\n\nDISTRICT OF PEKAN\n\nN 3.601046\n\nE 103.402078\n\nState Road\n\nLEGEND :\n\nROUTE NUMBER\n\nROAD TO BE GAZETTED AS\n\nFEDERAL ROAD\n\nFEDERAL ROAD\n\nROAD\n\nSTATE ROAD\n\n(b) under the heading \"Negeri Kelantan Darul Naim\"—\n\n(i) by inserting after item 40 the following item:\n\n\"41. (Route 34): Pasir Hor-Kadok Road\n\nFrom its junction with Route 209, Pasir Hor-Wakaf Che Yeh Road\n\nat coordinates N 6.078106, E 102.243248 and ending at\n\nits junction with Route D114, Perol Road at coordinates N\n\n6.019577, E 102.260136 including slip roads, junctions and\n\nroundabouts within boundaries of right of way as shown on MAP\n\n15: FEDERAL ROADS OF NEGERI KELANTAN (a distance of 7.169\n\nkm).\"; and\n\n(ii) by inserting after MAP 14: FEDERAL ROADS OF NEGERI KELANTAN\n\nthe following map:\n\n\".\n\n \"MAP 15: FEDERAL ROADS OF NEGERI KELANTAN\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]\n\nMade 16 August 2018\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/12 Jld.2; PN(PU2)391/XXXV]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMinister of Works\n\nN 6.078106\n\nE 102.243248\n\nN 6.019577\n\nE 102.260136\n\nD114\n\nPasir Hor – Kadok Road\n\nLEGEND:\n\nROAD TO BE GAZETTED AS\n\nFEDERAL ROAD\n\nFEDERAL ROAD\n\nSTATE ROAD\n\nROUTE NUMBER"
    }
