 "MY-H2249": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2249",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 2) Order 2016.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 15 July 2016.\n\nRemission of tax"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2.  (1)  Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53 ] by any of the\nfollowing individual or entity  in respect of any money payable under any agreement,\nnote, instrument or document in relation to  the product , facility, programme and\nguarantee referred to in paragraph 4 shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional  to which this Act\napplies by virtue of the Loans Guarantee  (Declaration of Bodies\nCorporate) (Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tingg i Nasional)\nOrder 2004 [P.U. (A) 408/2004];\n\n(b) any holder of the  Islamic Medium Term Notes, which in this Order\nis referred to as the \"Sukuk Murabahah\";\n\n(c) any other party to any agreement, note, instrument or document in\nrelation to the Islamic Medium  Term Notes Programme , which in\nthis Order is referred to as the  \"GG Sukuk Programme\", or the\nguarantee provided or to be provided by the Government of\nMalaysia, including any party to whom such agreement, note,\ninstrument or document is transferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3.  Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument or document in relation to the product, facility, programme\nand guarantee referred to in paragraph 4 shall be remitted in full.\n\nApplication"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Sukuk Murabahah  issued by the Perbadanan Tabung\nPendidikan Tinggi Nasional  pursuant to the GG Sukuk Programme\nin nominal value of up to eight billion ringgit\n(RM8,000,000,000.00);\n\nProvided that, the combined aggregate of the outstanding\nnominal value of the Sukuk Murabahah and the outstanding\nprincipal amount under the Syndicated Revolving Credit -i Facility,\nwhich in this Order is referred to as the \"S RC-i Facility\", shall not\nexceed eight billion ringgit (RM8,000,000,000.00);\n\n(b) the SRC-i Facility  in the aggregate principal amount of up to two\nbillion ringgit (RM2,000,000,000.00) subject to the combined\naggregate mentioned in subparagraph (a);\n\n(c) the GG Sukuk Programme in nominal value of up to eight bill ion\nringgit (RM8,000,000,000.00); and\n\n(d) the guarantee provided or to be provided by the Government of\nMalaysia relating to the Sukuk Murabahah and the SRC-i Facility.\n\nMade 30 June 2016\n[KK/BUU/(S)10/0.500 Sj. 1 Jld. 7/(3); PN(PU2)232/XI]\n\nDATO' JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
