 "MY-H2346": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2346",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. Negeri Kelantan 29.4.2021 – 17.5.2021"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Mukim Gali dan Tras, Daerah Raub, Negeri Pahang 30.4.2021 – 13.5.2021\".\n\nDibuat 30 April 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 6]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (MOVEMENT CONTROL)\n\n(NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 14) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas) (Movement Control)\n\n(No. 4) (Amendment) (No. 14) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 30 April 2021.\n\nAmendment of regulation 2\n\n2. The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (Movement Control) (No. 4) Regulations 2021\n\n[P.U. (A) 96/2021], which are referred to as the \"principal Regulations\"\n\nin these Regulations, are amended in regulation 2 by inserting after the words\n\n\"or district\" the words \"or mukim\".\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The principal Regulations are amended by substituting for the First Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\nAPPLICATION\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District/Mukim\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n1. State of Kelantan 29.4.2021 – 17.5.2021\n\n2. Mukim of Gali and Tras, Raub District, State of Pahang 30.4.2021 – 13.5.2021\".\n\nMade 30 April 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 6]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
