 "MY-H2359": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2359",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Poisons (Amendment of Poisons List) (No. 2) Order 2019.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Poisons Act 1952 is amended in the First Schedule—\n\n(a) in the Poisons List—\n\n(i) in the list of \"Antihistamines; the following:\", by inserting after the item \"Doxylamine\" the item \"Ebastine\";\n\n(ii) by inserting after the item \"Bretylium; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\n Group A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Brexpiprazole - All preparations\";\n\n(iii) by inserting after the item \"Chlorzoxazone\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nName Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Cholecalciferol - All medicinal\n\npreparations\n\ncontaining\n\n10,000 i.u. or\n\nmore of\n\ncholecalciferol\n\nper dosage\n\nunit\n\nAll\n\npreparations\n\nfor parenteral\n\nadministration\n\nunless in\n\nGroup B\n\n- - All preparations\n\nunless in Group B\n\n or Group C\";\n\n(iv) by inserting after the item \"Duloxetine; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n \"Dupilumab - All preparations\n\n Durvalumab - All preparations\";\n\n(v) by substituting for the item \"3,4-Methylenedioxy-methamphetamine (MDMA)(DD)\" the item\n\n\"3,4-Methylenedioxymethamphetamine (MDMA)(DD)\";\n\n(vi) by inserting after the item \"Pomalidomide\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Ponatinib - All preparations\";\n\n(vii) by inserting after the item \"Santonin\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Sapropterin - All preparations\"; and\n\n(viii) in the list of \"Vitamins; the following:\", by deleting the item \"Cholecalciferol\"; and\n\n(b) in the Appendix to the Poisons List—\n\n(i) in the list of \"Antihistamines:\", by inserting after the item \"Doxylamine\" the item \"Ebastine\";\n\n(ii) in the list of \"Antineoplastic agents and Immunosuppressants:\"—\n\n(A) by inserting after the item \"Docetaxel\" the item \"Durvalumab\"; and\n\n(B) by inserting after the item \"Pomalidomide\" the item \"Ponatinib\";\n\n(iii) in the list of \"Dermatological agents:\", by inserting after the item \"Dithranol\" the item \"Dupilumab\";\n\n(iv) in the list of \"Tranquillisers:\", by inserting after the item \"Benzquinamide\" the item \"Brexpiprazole\"; and\n\n(v) in the list of \"Miscellaneous:\", by inserting after the item \"Sabadilla, alkaloids of\" the item \"Sapropterin\".\n\nMade 25 June 2019\n\n[KKM.R.600-1/1/56 JLD.(4)(9); PN(PU2)172/XVII]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMinister of Health"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
