 "MY-H2452": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2452",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Stamp Duty (Remission) (No. 3) Order 2023.\n\nRemission"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The Minister remits the stamp duty under subsubitem 31(a)\nof the First Schedule to the Act which is in excess of zero point one per centum\nof the stamp duty payable on all instrument s of contract notes relating to the\nsales of any shares or stock which are listed on the stock market\nof a stock exchange approved under subsection 8(2) of the Capital Markets\nand Services Act 2007 [Act 671].\n\n (2) The Minister further remits the stamp duty payable after the remission\nunder subparagraph 2(1) which is in excess of one thousand ringgit.\n\n (3) The remission under this Ord er shall only apply  to the instrument s\nof contract notes executed on or after 13 July 2023 but not later than 12 July 2028.\n\nRevocation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Stamp Duty (Remission) Order 2022 [P.U. (A) 112/2022] is revoked.\n\nMade 12 July 2023\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/11 JLD.5; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-313; PN(PU2)159/JLD.37]\n\nANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\nMinister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
