     "en": "1.       (1)    This         order         may         be         cited         as         the         Sales         Tax\n\n(Persons Exempted From Payment Of Tax) Order 2018.\n\n(2)    This Order comes into operation on 1 September 2018.\n\nExemption from payment of sales tax"
