 "MY-H2493": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2493",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the National Skills Development (Waiver\n\nof Fee to Persons with Disabilities) Regulations 2019.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 29 July 2019.\n\nWaiver of fee"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Subject to subregulation (2), the fee prescribed in item 1(a)(ii), (b)(ii), (c)(ii)\n\nand (d)(ii) of the Second Schedule to the National Skills Development (Fees and Charges)\n\nRegulations 2016 [P.U. (A) 86/2016] is waived in respect of a person with disability who\n\napplies for the recognition of prior skills achievement leading to the award of the\n\nMalaysian Skills Certificate, Malaysian Skills Diploma, Malaysian Skills Advanced\n\nDiploma or Statement of Achievement, as the case may be.\n\n(2) The waiver of fee under subregulation (1) is applicable—\n\n(a) to a person with disabilities registered with the Social Welfare\n\nDepartment, Ministry of Women, Family and Community Development;\n\nand\n\n(b) for recognition of prior skills achievement in relation to any field which\n\nsatisfies the requirements of the relevant Standards.\n\nMade 17 July 2019\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/16/1; PN(PU2)655/V]\n\nM.KULASEGARAN\n\nMinister of Human Resources"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
