 "MY-H2501": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2501",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Islamic Financial Services ( Contract of\nGeneral Takaful for Property or Liability) Order 2013.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 30 June 2013.\n\nContract of general takaful for property or liability"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) No person shall enter into or cause to be entered into, a contract of\ngeneral takaful in respect of property or liability with a takaful operator other than a\nlicensed general takaful operator.\n\n (2) For purposes of subparagraph (1)—\n\n(a)     \"property\" means—\n(i) property, movable or immovable, located in Malaysia; or\n\n(ii) a ship or aircraft registered in Malaysia;\n\n(b) \"liability\" means liability of a person resident in Malaysia to a third\nparty.\n\nMade 19 June 2013\n[BNM/JUN/1125/50/01; PN(PU2)717]\n\nTAN SRI DATO' SRI DR. ZETI AKHTAR AZIZ\n                                                                   Governor\n                                                                                Central Bank of Malaysia"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
