    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The pr incipal Regulations are amended i n the First Schedule, in Part I ,\nunder the subheading \"States of Malaya\" by substituting for the Customs Port\n\"Tanjung Langsat, Johor\" and the particulars relating to it the following particulars:\n\nCustoms Port Description of Goods Legal Landing Place\n\n\"Tanjung Langsat,\nMukim Sungai Tiram,\nDistrict of Johor\nBahru, Johor\nAll goods The J etty of Tanjung Langsat\nIndustrial Complex, Mukim Sungai\nTiram, District of Johor Bahru, Johor,\nextending for a distance of 1188.335\nmeters to the sea located on the\nwest bank of Sungai Johor at:\n\nJetty No. 1 (JETTY F):\nLatitude:    1:26'16.06\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'33.15\"E\n\nJetty No. 2 (JETTY E):\nLatitude:    1:26'18.57\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'31.33\"E\n\nJetty No. 3 (JETTY D):\nLatitude:    1:26'30.25\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'36.27\"E\n\nP.U. (A)\n\nJetty No. 4 (JETTY C):\nLatitude:    1:26'30.71\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'34.65\"E\n\nJetty No. 5 (JETTY B):\nLatitude:    1:26'43.14\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'40.23\"E\n\nJetty No. 6 (DRY CARGO JETTY):\nLatitude:    1:27'19.69\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'41.03\"E\n\nJetty No. 7 (DRY CARGO JETTY):\nLatitude:    1:27'26.39\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'42.42\"E\n\nJetty No. 8 (JETTY A)\nLatitude:    1:26'54.55\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'43.13\"E\n\nJetty No. 9 (JETTY G):\nLatitude:    1:26'00.53\"N\nLongitude: 104:00'29.13\"E\".\n\nMade 22 July 2016\n[SULIT KE.HT (96) 667/07-16/T Klt.9 S.K.1 ; Perb. (c)0.217/32JLD.2(SK.5);\nPN(PU2)338/XXXIX]\n\nDATUK JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    }
