 "MY-H2558": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2558",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Customs (Anti-Dumping Duties)\n\n(No. 3) 2020 (Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 12 December 2020\n\nand shall continue to be in operation until 11 December 2025.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Customs (Anti-Dumping Duties) (No. 3) Order 2020 [P.U. (A) 348/2020],\n\nwhich is referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended in paragraph 2\n\nby substituting for subparagraph (2) the following subparagraph:\n\n\"(2) Notwithstanding subparagraph 2(1), anti-dumping duties\n\nshall not be imposed on the goods specified in columns (1) and (2)\n\nof the Schedule exported from The People's Republic of China by producer or\n\nexporter Yieh Phui (China) Technomaterial Co., Ltd. and The Socialist Republic\n\nof Viet Nam by producer or exporter Southern Steel Sheet Co., Ltd.,\n\nTan Phuoc Khanh Trading & Manufacturing Coil Steel JSC, Hoa Sen Group and\n\nTon Dong A Corporation.\".\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Schedule to the principal Order is amended in column (4), in relation to\n\nThe Socialist Republic of Viet Nam―\n\n(a) by deleting the words \"Hoa Sen Group\" and the particulars\n\nrelating to it in column (5);\n\n(b) by deleting the words \"Ton Dong A Corporation\" and the particulars\n\nrelating to it in column (5); and\n\n(c) by substituting for the words \"Others (except Southern Steel Sheet Co., Ltd.\n\nand Tan Phuoc Khanh Trading & Manufacturing Coil Steel JSC)\"\n\nthe words \"Others (except Southern Steel Sheet Co., Ltd.,\n\nTan Phuoc Khanh Trading & Manufacturing Coil Steel JSC, Hoa Sen Group\n\nand Ton Dong A Corporation)\".\n\nMade 17 July 2023\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249Klt.12Sk.8; MOF.TAX(S)700-4/1/672Jld.2; PN(PU2)338D/JLD.7]\n\n ANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\n\n Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
