     "en": "2. The Schedule to the Factories and Machinery (Exemption to Petronas Penapisan\n\n(Melaka) Sdn. Bhd., Sungai Udang, Melaka) Order 2013 [P.U. (A) 158/2013] is amended—\n\n(a) by deleting the item \"PMT 111424\" and the particulars relating to it;\n\n(b) by inserting after the item \"PMT 111485\" and the particulars relating to it\n\nthe following item and particulars:\n\n(1) (2)\n\nRegistration No. Description of Machinery\n\n\"PMT 111486 Unfired pressure vessel\";\n\n(c) by inserting after the item \"PMT 111979\" and the particulars relating to it\n\nthe following item and particulars:\n\n(1) (2)\n\nRegistration No. Description of Machinery\n\n\"PMT 112046 Unfired pressure vessel\"; and\n\n(d) by inserting after the item \"MK PMT 766\" and the particulars relating to it\n\nthe following item and particulars:\n\n(1) (2)\n\nRegistration No. Description of Machinery\n\n\"MK PMT 767 Unfired pressure vessel\".\n\nMade 24 June 2013\n\n[KSM/PUU/T/01/02/03 Jld.22; PN(PU2)235/XXXVII]\n\n DATUK RICHARD RIOT ANAK JAEM\n\n Minister of Human Resources"
