 "MY-H2634": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2634",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Financial Services (Exemption)\nOrder 2020.\n\n (2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 25 March 2020.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The Minister exempts—\n\n(a) Hydor AS, an insurance agency registered in Norway from the\napplication of paragraph 8(1)(a) of the Act  for the purpose of\ncarrying on insurance business in respect of protection and\nindemnity insurance for  a ship of 5,000  gross tonnage or less for\na period of two years; and\n\n(b) Archipelago Insurance Limited  (Licence No. IS2013136),\nan insurance licensee under the Labuan Financial Services and\nSecurities Act 2010 [ Act 704 ] fr om the application of\nparagraph 8(1)(a) of the Act for the purpose of carrying on\ninsurance business in respect of protection and indemnity\ninsurance for a Malaysian ship of 300 gross tonnage or less for\na period of one year.\n\n (2) In this paragraph—\n\n(a) \"protection and indemnity insurance\" means the protection and\nindemnity insurance offered by Hydor AS or Archipelago Insurance\nLimited, as the case may be, in collaboration with the\nPerlindungan dan Indemniti Malaysia Sdn. Bhd.; and\n\n(b) \"Malaysian ship\" has the meaning assigned to it in subsection 11(1)\nof the Merchant Shipping Ordinance 1952 [Ord. 70/1952].\n\nMade  23 July 2020\n[MOF.SID(S)700-1/2/20(SK.1)(7); PN(PU2)718/V]\n\nTENGKU DATO' SRI ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
