 "MY-H2638": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2638",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Cyber Security\n(Period for Cyber Security Risk Assessment and Audit) Regulations 2024.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 26 August 2024.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In these Regulations, \"cyber security risks\"  means the risks\nthat a vulnerability in the cyber security of the national critical information\ninfrastructure may be exploited by a cyber security threat or cyber security incident.\n\nPeriod to conduct cyber security risk assessment and audit"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. A national critical information infrastructure entity owned or operated\na national critical information infrastructure shall—\n\n(a) conduct a cyber security risk assessment at least once a year; and\n\n(b) carrying out an audit at least once in every two years or at such higher\nfrequency as may be directed by the Chief Executive in any particular case.\n\nMade 16 August 2024\n[MKN(S).10.600-9/2/4 Jld.9 (6); PN(PU2)768]\n\nDATO' SERI ANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\nPrime Minister"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
