 "MY-H2722": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2722",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Ministers of the Federal Government\n\n(No. 2) (Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2015.\n\n(2) Except for subsubparagraphs 2(a)(iii), 2(a)(iv), 2(a)(v), 2(c) and 2(d), this\n\nOrder is deemed to have come into operation on 16 May 2013.\n\n(3) Subsubparagraphs 2(a)(iii) and 2(d) are deemed to have come into\n\noperation on 1 January 2015.\n\n(4) Subsubparagraphs 2(a)(iv) and 2(c) are deemed to have come into\n\noperation on 27 June 2014.\n\n(5) Subsubparagraph 2(a)(v) is deemed to have come into operation\n\non 21 March 2014.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Schedule to the Ministers of the Federal Government Order (No. 2) 2013\n\n[P.U. (A) 184/2013] is amended―\n\n(a) in respect of the Prime Minister's Department―\n\n(i) by inserting in the \"Subjects\" column after the words\n\n\"Co-ordinating cross-cutting socio-economic issues involving\n\nvarious sectors through the Economic Council meetings\" appearing\n\nagainst the words \"Economic Planning Unit (UPE)\" in the\n\n\"Departments\" column the words \"Formulation and\n\nimplementation of the national policy on energy\";\n\n(ii) by inserting in the \"Subjects\" column after the words\n\n\"Strengthening energy resources to ensure the energy supply is of\n\nquality, reliable and cost effective\" appearing against the words\n\n\"Economic Planning Unit (UPE)\" in the \"Departments\" column the\n\nfollowing words:\n\n \"Development of oil and gas industry\n\n Co-ordinating and monitoring the operations of the\n\nMalaysia- Thailand Joint Authority\";\n\n(iii) by deleting the words \"Native Court in the Federal Territory of\n\nLabuan\" in the \"Departments\" column and all words appearing\n\nagainst it in the \"Subjects\" column;\n\n(iv) by inserting in the \"Departments\" and \"Subjects\" columns after the\n\nwords \"National Legal Aid Foundation\" in the \"Departments\"\n\ncolumn the following words:\n\n\"Hawkers, Petty\n\nTraders and\n\nHindu\n\nEndowment Unit\n\nChinese hawkers and petty traders\n\ndevelopment in the country\n\nPresentation of Annual Report and\n\nFinancial Statement of the Penang State\n\nHindu Endowment Board\n\nChinese New\n\nVillage Division\n\nDevelopment of Chinese New Village\n\nSME and Micro\n\nCredit\n\nDevelopment\n\nUnit\n\nChinese Small and Medium Enterprises\n\n(SMEs) development and Micro Credit\n\nProgrammes related to Chinese SMEs\n\ndevelopment\"; and\n\n(v) by inserting in the \"Departments\" and \"Subjects\" columns after the\n\nwords \"SME and Micro Credit Development Unit\" in the\n\n\"Departments\" column the following words:\n\n\"National\n\nCouncil\n\nof Professors\n\nTo facilitate scholastic development\n\nactivities such as promoting and\n\nstimulating scholarship and intellectual\n\ndevelopment for the nation through\n\npertinent programmes conducted from\n\ntime to time\n\nTo assist in fomulating national policies\n\nsuch as analysing problems, identifying\n\nrisks and recommending various\n\nalternative solutions to the government\n\nTo serve as a link between the national\n\nacademia and the government, industry\n\nand community\"; and\n\n(b) in respect of the Ministry of Energy, Green Technology and Water, by\n\nsubstituting for the words \"Formulation and implementation of national\n\npolicy on energy\" in the \"Subjects\" column the words \"Strengthening\n\nenergy resources to ensure electricity supply is of quality, reliable and\n\ncost effective\";\n\n(c) in respect of the Ministry of Women, Family and Community\n\nDevelopment, by deleting the words \"Presentation of Annual Report and\n\nFinancial Statement of the Penang State Hindu Endowment Board\" in the\n\n\"Subjects\" column; and\n\n(d) in respect of the Ministry of Federal Territories, by inserting in the\n\n\"Departments\" and \"Subjects\" columns after the words \"Majlis Sukan\n\nWilayah Persekutuan Putrajaya\" in the \"Departments\" column the\n\nfollowing words:\n\n\"Native Court in the\n\nFederal Territory\n\nof Labuan\n\nAdministration of Native Courts in the\n\nFederal Territory of Labuan\n\nLabuan Native Title Act 2007\".\n\nMade 6 October 2015\n\n[PM(BK)R. 11456/13 Jld. 56; PN(PU2)18/XXVII]\n\n By Command\n\nTAN SRI DR. ALI BIN HAMSA\n\nSecretary to the Cabinet"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
