    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Free Zones Regulations 1991 [P.U. (A) 321/1991] are amended\n\nin the Fourth Schedule—\n\n(a) in the national language text, in Part I, in item 2(b), in relation to\n\nthe state of Pulau Pinang, in column (2), by substituting for the words\n\n\"Dermaga Air Dalam, Seksyen 4, bandar Butterworth, Daerah Utara,\n\nPerdagangan Seberang Perai\" the words \"Dermaga Air Dalam, Seksyen 4,\n\nbandar Butterworth, Daerah Utara, Seberang Perai\"; and\n\n(b) in Part II, in paragraph 2, in relation to the state of Penang,\n\nby inserting after the item \"Bayan Lepas, South West District, Mukim 12\"\n\nand the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\n(2)\n\nFree Zones\n\n(3)\n\nOrdinary Working Hours/\n\nWorking Days\n\n\"Deep Water Wharf, Section 4,\n\ncity of Butterworth, District of North\n\nSeberang Perai\n\nMonday to Friday:\n\n8.00 a.m. to 11.00 p.m.\n\nSaturday:\n\n9.00 a.m. to 6.00 p.m.\".\n\nMade 17 July 2023\n\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-2/5/23(17); SULIT.KE.HD(122)860/02Klt.5(10); PN(PU2)485/XI]\n\n ANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\n\n Minister of Finance"
    }
