     "en": "2. The Weight Restrictions (Federal Roads) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 478/1989] is\n\namended in the First Schedule in relation to the heading \"TYPE OF VEHICLE\"—\n\n(a) under the subheading \"RIGID VEHICLES\", in column \"Roads specified in\n\nList I of Second Schedule\"—\n\n(i) in relation to item \"2-Axle\", by substituting for the\n\nword \"18\" the word \"19\"; and\n\n(ii) in relation to subitem 3 of item \"3-Axle\", by substituting for the\n\nword \"26\" the word \"27\"; and\n\n(b) under the subheading \"ARTICULATED VEHICLES\", in column\n\n\"Roads specified in List I of Second Schedule\"—\n\n(i) in relation to item \"3-Axle\", by substituting for the word \"30\" the\n\nword \"31\";\n\n(ii) in relation to subitem 3 of item \"4-Axle\", by substituting for the\n\nword \"37\" the word \"39\";\n\n(iii) in relation to item \"5-Axle\", by substituting for the word \"40\" the\n\nword \"45\"; and\n\n(iv) in relation to item \"6-Axle\", by substituting for the\n\nword \"44\" the word \"50\".\n\nMade 28 July 2017\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/16 Jld.2; PN(PU2)460/XCI]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works"
