    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Ministers of the Federal Government\n\n(No. 2) (Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2016.\n\n(2) Except for subsubparagraphs 2(a)(ii), 2(a)(iii), 2(d)(i) and 2(d)(ii), this\n\nOrder is deemed to have come into operation on 28 June 2016.\n\n(3) Subsubparagraph 2(a)(ii) is deemed to have come into operation\n\non 3 September 2015.\n\n(4) Subsubparagraph 2(a)(iii) is deemed to have come into operation\n\non 5 June 2016.\n\n(5) Subsubparagraph 2(d)(i) is deemed to have come into operation\n\non 9 May 2016.\n\n(6) Subsubparagraph 2(d)(ii) is deemed to have come into operation\n\non 5 May 2016.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    }
