     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] is amended\n\nin the First Schedule under the heading of Negeri Kelantan Darul Naim—\n\n(a) by substituting for item 7 the following item:\n\n\"7. (Route 57): Kota Bharu-Sabak Road\n\nStarting from the junction of Route 3, Kota Bharu-Rantau Panjang\n\nRoad at coordinates N 6.109390, E 102.254918 and ending\n\nat coordinates N 6.173987, E 102.325519 including its link road\n\nwithin the boundaries of right of way as shown on MAP 22:\n\nKOTA BHARU-SABAK ROAD (a distance of 13.303km).\";\n\n(b) by substituting for item 11 the following item:\n\n\"11. (Route 131): Kubang Kerian-Sabak Road\n\nStarting from the junction of Route 3, Kota Bharu-Rantau Panjang\n\nRoad at coordinates N 6.091277, E 102.276176 and ending\n\nat the junction of Route 57, Kota Bharu-Sabak Road at coordinates\n\nN 6.173101, E 102.320051 including its link road within\n\nthe boundaries of right of way as shown on MAP 23: KUBANG\n\nKERIAN-SABAK ROAD (a distance of 10.963 km).\";\n\n(c) by deleting item 13; and\n\n(d) by inserting after MAP 21: SULTAN ISMAIL PETRA ROAD\n\nthe following maps:\n\n\"MAP 22: KOTA BHARU-SABAK ROAD\n\nMAP 23: KUBANG KERIAN-SABAK ROAD\n\nMade 28 August 2024\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/22; PN(PU2)391/JLD.49]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Minister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]\n\n\"."
