 "MY-H2803": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2803",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Real Property Gains Tax (Exemption)\nOrder 2014.\n\n(2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2013.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order, \"conventional partnership\", \"limited liability partnership\" and\n\"private company\" have the same meaning assigned to them under the Limited Liability\nPartnership Act 2012 [Act 743].\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3.  (1) The Minister exempts any person from the payment of real property gains\ntax on the chargeable gains accruing on the conveyance of any chargeable asset relating\nto the conversion of a conventional partnership or a private company to  be a limited\nliability partnership registered on or after 1 January 2013 until 31 December 2017.\n\n (2) The conveyance referred to in subparagraph (1) shall be deemed to take\nplace on the date the conventional partnership or private company is registered as a\nlimited liability partnership unde r section 32 of the Limited L iability Partnership Act\n\n  (3) The person referred to in subpara graph (1) shall, upon sub mitting the\nreturn under the Act, furnish—\n\n(a) a confirmation from Companies Com mission of Malaysia\nconfirming that at the date of re gistration of the limited liability\n\npartnership, the partners of the limited liability partnership are all\nthe partners of the conventional partnership which converted to be\nthe limited liability partnership or the partners of the limited\nliability partner ship are all the shareholders of the private\ncompany that converted to be the limited liability partnership; and\n\n(b)   a list of asset to be transferred to the limited liability partnership.\n\nMade 4 August 2014\n[Perb.CR(8.09)681/2-61(SJ.57)(SK.2);LHDN.01/35/(S)/42/51/Klt.19; PN(PU2)325/IV]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 9(4) of the Real Property\nGains Tax Act 1976]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
