     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Income Tax (Deduction for Employment\n\nof Approved Individual) Rules 2026.\n\n(2) These Rules have effect from the year of assessment 2025 to\n\nthe year of assessment 2027.\n\nDeduction"
