 "MY-H2860": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2860",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Fees (Employment Pass, Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary Employment) and Work Pass) (Amendment) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 August 2023.\n\nSubstitution of Schedule IB"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Fees (Employment Pass, Visit Pass (Temporary Employment)\n\nand Work Pass) Order 1998 [P.U. (A) 479/1998] is amended by substituting for the\n\nSchedule IB the following schedule:\n\n\"SCHEDULE IB\n\n[Paragraph 3B]\n\n(1)\n\nType of Pass\n\n(2)\n\nFee\n\n(RM)\n\n(a) Work Pass 1,500.00\n\n (b) Visit Pass (Temporary Employment) for\n\nthe following sectors:\n\n(i) manufacturing 1,500.00\n\n(ii) construction 1,500.00\n\n(1)\n\nType of Pass\n\n(2)\n\nFee\n\n(RM)\n\n(iii) plantation 1,500.00\n\n(iv) agriculture for—\n\n(A) plants 1,500.00\n\n(B) livestock 1,500.00\n\n(C) aquaculture 1,500.00\n\n(D) swallow's nest 1,500.00\n\n(E) slaughter house 1,500.00\n\n(v) mining and quarry in Sarawak 1,500.00\n\n(vi) services for—\n\n(A) restaurant 1,500.00\n\n(B) washing and cleaning 1,500.00\n\n(C) wholesale and retail business 1,500.00\n\n(D) laundry 1,500.00\n\n(E) hotel 1,500.00\n\n(F) resort island 1,500.00\n\n(G) spa 1,500.00\n\n(H) reflexology 1,500.00\n\n(I) caddy 1,500.00\n\n(J) cargo (port and airport) 1,500.00\n\n(K) warehouse 1,500.00\n\n(1)\n\nType of Pass\n\n(2)\n\nFee\n\n(RM)\n\n(L) scrap and used metal 1,500.00\n\n(M) transportation in Sarawak 1,500.00\n\n(vii) security control 1,500.00\n\n(viii) maid 1,500.00\".\n\nMade 17 July 2023\n\n[KDN:IM.R.600-3/21/1; KDN.PUU.S.600-4/1/1; PN(PU2)86/JLD.28]\n\nBy Command\n\n TAN SRI DATO' SERI MOHD ZUKI BIN ALI\n\n Secretary to the Cabinet\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Fees Act 1951]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
