 "MY-H2875": {
  "lawId": "MY-H2875",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (West Malaysia)\n\n(Amendment) (No. 11) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 4 August 2023.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] is amended\n\nin the First Schedule under the heading of Negeri Terengganu Darul Iman—\n\n(a) by substituting for item 7 the following item:\n\n\"7. (Route 106): Ajil–Kuala Berang Road\n\nStarting from the junction of Route 247, Kuala Berang–Sungai Tong\n\nRoad at coordinates N 5.076055, E 102.997250 and ending at the\n\njunction of Route 14, Kuala Terengganu–Bukit Besi Road\n\nat coordinates N 5.082186, E 103.085811 including its link roads\n\nwithin the boundaries of right of way as shown on MAP 21:\n\nAJIL–KUALA BERANG ROAD (a distance of 10.110 km).\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after MAP 20: PERMAISURI–BULATAN CHE SELAMAH ROAD\n\nthe following map:\n\n\"MAP 21: AJIL–KUALA BERANG ROAD\n\nMade 3 August 2023\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/21; PN(PU2)391/Jld. 46]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Minister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]\n\n\"."
    }
   }
  ]
 },
