    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Weight Restrictions (Federal Roads) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 478/1989]\n\nis amended in List I of the Second Schedule under the heading STATE OF KEDAH\n\nby inserting after item 12 the following item:\n\n\"13. Kg. Padang Lalang – Penarak, Pulau Langkawi Road (Route 156)\n\nFrom the junction of Kuah Air Hangat Road with Route 112\n\nat coordinates N 6.324949, E 99.848352 via Padang Lalang and\n\nending at Penarak at coordinates N 6.309039, E 99.862966\n\n(a distance of 2.74 km).\".\n\nMade 25 August 2020\n\n[KKR.PUU. 110-1/6/16 Jld.2; PN(PU2)460/CVII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nSenior Minister of Works"
    }
