    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The maximum producer price for the price -controlled goods specified\nin column (1) of the First Schedule for the State of Sarawak is determined according to\nthe districts as specified in column (2).\n\nMaximum wholesale price"
    }
