     "en": "1. Pendaftaran amanah Labuan atau amanah khas Labuan 300\n\nDibuat 26 Jun 2026\n\n[LFSA.400-15/Peraturan AmanahLabuan/Vol1/2025; PN(PU2)567]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nLABUAN TRUSTS ACT 1996\n\nLABUAN TRUSTS (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 57(1) of the\n\nLabuan Trusts Act 1996 [Act 554], the Minister, on recommendation of the Authority,\n\nmakes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Labuan Trusts (Amendment)\n\nRegulations 2026.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 July 2026.\n\nSubstitution of Third Schedule"
