     "en": "2. The Labuan Trusts Regulations 2010 [P.U. (A) 415/2010] are amended\n\nby substituting for the Third Schedule the following schedule:\n\n\"THIRD SCHEDULE\n\n[Regulation 8]\n\nPAYMENTOF FEE\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nItem\n\n(3)\n\nFee\n\n(USD)\n\n\". 1. Registration of a Labuan trust or a Labuan special trust 300\n\nMade 26 June 2026\n\n[LFSA.400-15/PeraturanAmanahLabuan/Vol1/2025; PN(PU2)567]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\n\nFinance Minister II"
