    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Determination of Maximum Price) (No. 5) Order 2013.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 26 July 2013 to 11 August 2013.\n\nMaximum producer price"
    }
