     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Langkawi International Yacht\n\nRegistry (Registration of Yachts) Regulations (Amendment) 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 28 August 2020.\n\nAmendment of regulation 8"
