  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the National Speed Limit (Temporary\n\nCessation) (No. 2) Order 2012.\n\n (2) This Order has effect from 12 August 2012 to 26 August 2012.\n\nTemporary Cessation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Subparagraph 2(1) of the National Speed Limit Order 1989\n\n[P.U. (A) 18/1989] which provides the speed limit of 90 kilometers per hour for all\n\nroads in Malaysia, other than the roads described in the Schedule to the National Speed\n\nLimit Order 1989, shall cease to have effect for the period from 12 August 2012 to\n\n26 August 2012.\n\n(2) Upon the expiry of this Order, subparagraph 2(1) of the National Speed\n\nLimit Order 1989 shall have effect as if this Order has not been made.\n\nMade 2 August 2012\n\n[KP.PUU/W/BD/9; PN(PU2)460/LXVII]\n\n DATO' SERI KONG CHO HA\n\n Minister of Transport"
    }
   }
  ]
