     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Employees' Minimum Standards of\n\nHousing, Accommodations and Amenities (Maximum Rental or Charges for\n\nAccommodation) Regulations 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 September 2020.\n\nMaximum rental or charges for accommodation"
