 "MY-H3165": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3165",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport (Amendment of Second\n\nSchedule) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 September 2023.\n\nAmendment of Second Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Second Schedule to the Road Transport Act 1987 is amended\n\nby inserting after paragraph (iii) the following paragraphs:\n\n\"(iv) Using, or causing or permitting to be used, a motor vehicle in respect of\n\nwhich there is not in force a motor vehicle licence granted under the Act\n\n(v) Using, or causing or permitting to be used, a motor vehicle which does\n\nnot have a policy of insurance or any security in respect of third party risks\n\nwhich complies with the requirements of the Act\n\n(vi) Driving or permitting to be driven a motor vehicle which the laden weight\n\nof the motor vehicle exceed the maximum permissible laden weight\n\n(vii) Causing or permitting a motor vehicle to remain at rest on any road\n\nin any position, condition or circumstances as to be likely to cause danger,\n\nobstruction or undue inconvenience to other users of the road or to traffic\".\n\nMade 15 August 2023\n\n[MOT. BD. (R). 600-1/5/4(5); PN(PU2)460/Jld. 127]\n\nLOKE SIEW FOOK\n\nMinister of Transport"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H3166": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3166",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Income Tax ( Unit Trust ) (Exemption)\nOrder 2024.\n\n (2) This Order has effect from 1 January 2024 to 31 December 2028.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The Minister exempts a qualifying unit trust resident in Malaysia\nfrom the payment of income tax in respect of any gains or profit received from the disposal\nof shares of a company incorporated in Malaysia  which is  not listed\non the stock exchange and from the disposal of shares under section 15C of the Act.\n\n (2) For the purposes of this Order, the qualifying unit trust referred\nto in subparagraph (1) shall not include a unit trust which is approved by\nthe Securities Commission as a Real Estate Investment Trust or Property Trust Fund listed\non Bursa Malaysia.\n\n(3) The disposal of shares referred to in s ubparagraph (1) shall be made from\n1 January 2024 to 31 December 2028.\n\n (4) Nothing in subparagraph (1) shall absolve or be deemed to have absolved\nthe qualifying unit trust from complying with any requirement to submit any return\nor statement of accounts or to furnish any other information under the Act.\n\nLoss from disposal of shares"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. In ascertaining the chargeable income exempted under subparagraph 2(1),\nany loss from the disposal of  shares shall be allowed as  a deduction in accordance with\nsubsections 65E(5) and (6) of the Act.\n\nNon-application"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. This Order shall not apply to a disposal of shares  referred to in subparagraph 2(1)\nwhere gains or profits from the disposal of shares is chargeable to tax as a business income\nunder paragraph 4(a) of the Act.\n\nMade 19 September 2024\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-2/1/261;LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-365; PN(PU2)80/JLD.112]\n\n     DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n   Minister of Finance II\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 127(4) of the Income Tax Act 1967]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
