 "MY-H3249": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3249",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Financial Services\n(Protection and Indemnity Insurance in respect of Ships) (Exemption) Order 2024.\n\n (2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 25  March 2024\nand shall continue to be in operation until 24 March 2027.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order—\n\n(a) \"protection and indemnity insurance\" means the protection and\nindemnity insurance offered either—\n\n(i) in collaboration with Perlindungan dan Indemniti\nMalaysia Sdn. Bhd.; or\n\n(ii) in a co -insurance arrangement with a licensed insurer\nunder the Act;\n\n(b) \"Malaysian ship\" has the meaning assigned to it in subsection 11(1)\nof the Merchant Shipping Ordinance 1952 [Ord. 70/1952].\n\nExemption from paragraph 8(1)(a) of the Act"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Minister exempts  the following person from the application\nof paragraph 8(1) (a) of the Act for the purpose of carrying on insurance business\nrelating to protection and indemnity insurance:\n\n(a) in respect of a Malaysian ship of 300 gross tonnage or less ,\nArchipelago Insurance Limited (Licence No. IS2013136), an insurance\nlicensee under the Labuan Financial Services and Securities Act 2010\n[Act 704]; and\n\n(b) in respect of a ship of 30,000 gross tonnage or less , which is not limited\nto Malaysian ship,—\n\n(i) Great American Insurance Company  (Singapore Branch) ,\nan insurer licensed in Singapore;\n\n(ii) Maritime Mutual Insurance Association (NZ) Limited,\na financial service provider registered in New Zealand; and\n\n(iii) the members of the International Group of Protection and\nIndemnity Clubs (IGP&I).\n\nExemption from subsection 127(1) of the Act"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any person who enters into or causes to be entered into any contract in respect\nof protection and indemnity insurance for a ship with a person exempted as specified\nin paragraph 3 is exempted from the application of subsection 127(1) of the Act.\n\nMade  20 September 2024\n[MOF.SID(S)700-1/2/20(SK.6); PN(PU2)717/JLD.4]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n               Finance Minister II"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
