 "MY-H3264": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3264",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) (No. 3)\n\nOrder 2023.\n\n(2) This Order has effect for the period from 2 June 2023\n\nto 31 December 2023.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Subject to paragraph 3, the Minister exempts Sumisaujana TCM\n\nChemicals Sdn. Bhd. (Company Registration Number: 201001023293 (907064-U))\n\nin relation to a pesticide containing dimethyl disulfide (DMDS) as its active ingredient\n\nfrom—\n\n(a) the requirement to register the pesticide under section 7 of the Act;\n\n(b) the prohibition under paragraph 13(1)(b) of the Act for the purpose of\n\nimportation of the pesticide; and\n\n(c) the requirement to obtain a license to sell or store for sale the pesticide\n\nunder section 17 of the Act.\n\nConditions of exemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a) Sumisaujana TCM Chemicals Sdn. Bhd. shall import the pesticide\n\nonly to Pengerang Refining Company Sdn. Bhd.\n\n(Company Registration Number: 201301028727 (1058557-T));\n\n(b) Pengerang Refining Company Sdn. Bhd. shall use the pesticide only\n\nfor the purposes of oil and gas operation;\n\n(c) Sumisaujana TCM Chemicals Sdn. Bhd. shall submit information\n\nfor the purposes of registration to the Board as required under\n\nthe Pesticides (Registration) Rules 2005 [P.U. (A) 302/2005]\n\nwithin the period of exemption;\n\n(d) Sumisaujana TCM Chemicals Sdn. Bhd. shall submit one copy\n\nof purchase order of the pesticide to the Board each time before\n\nthe importation of the pesticide is carried out; and\n\n(e) Sumisaujana TCM Chemicals Sdn. Bhd. shall submit a report\n\nprepared by Pengerang Refining Company Sdn. Bhd. to the Board\n\neach month in respect of—\n\n(i) the importation of the pesticide by Sumisaujana TCM\n\nChemicals Sdn. Bhd.; and\n\n(ii) the use of the pesticide by Pengerang Refining Company\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\n(2) The Minister may revoke the exemption under paragraph 2 if any condition\n\nunder subparagraph (1) is not complied with.\n\nMade 31 July 2023\n\n[KP/LA/8/11; PN(PU2)275/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI HAJI MOHAMAD BIN SABU\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Food Security"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
