     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Regular Forces (Pensions,\n\nGratuities and Other Benefits) (Amendment) (No. 2) Regulations 2025.\n\n(2) These Regulations are deemed to have come into operation\n\non 1 January 2009.\n\nAmendment of regulation 19"
