 "MY-H3366": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3366",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Private Healthcare Facilities and\n\nServices (Private Hospitals and Other Private Healthcare Facilities) (Amendment)\n\nOrder 2016.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 15 October 2016.\n\nAmendment of Thirteenth Schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Thirteenth Schedule to the Private Healthcare Facilities and Services\n\n(Private Hospitals and Other Private Healthcare Facilities) Regulations 2006\n\n[P.U. (A) 138/2006], are amended in Part A—\n\n(a) in note 1, by inserting after the definition of \"emergency\" the following\n\ndefinition:\n\n‘ \"foreign person\" means a person who is not a citizen of Malaysia\n\nbut does not include—\n\n(a) a person who is not a citizen of Malaysia holding an\n\nidentity card issued under paragraph 5(3)(b)\n\nof the National Registration Regulations 1990\n\n[P.U. (A) 472/1990];\n\n(b) a non- citizen spouse of a citizen of Malaysia;\n\n(c) a person who is not a citizen of Malaysia\n\nholding an Employment Pass issued under\n\nsubregulation 9(1) of the Immigration\n\nRegulations 1963 [L.N. 228/63];\n\n(d) a person who is not a citizen of Malaysia holding\n\na Student's Pass issued under subregulation 13(1)\n\nof the Immigration Regulations 1963 [L.N. 228/63];\n\n(e) a person who is not a citizen of Malaysia holding a\n\nWork Pass for Sabah issued under\n\nsubregulation 16(1) of the Immigration\n\nRegulations 1963 [L.N. 228/63];\n\n(f) a person who is not a citizen of Malaysia\n\nholding a Residence Pass issued under\n\nsubregulation 16A(1) of the Immigration\n\nRegulations 1963 [L.N. 228/63]; or\n\n(g) a person who is not a citizen of Malaysia holding\n\na Visit Pass issued under paragraph 2 of\n\nthe Immigration (Malaysia My Second\n\nHome Programme) (Exemption) Order 2006\n\n[P.U. (A) 277/2006];';\n\n(b) by substituting for note 2 the following note:\n\n\"2. All fees in this Schedule are the maximum chargeable fees\n\nunless specified otherwise.\"; and\n\n(c) by inserting after note 2 the following note:\n\n\"2A. A patient who is a foreign person may be charged with an\n\nadditional fee not exceeding 25% of any chargeable fee in this\n\nSchedule.\".\n\nMade 7 October 2016\n\n[KKR/654(336); PN(PU2)601/V]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\nMinister of Health"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
