    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Speed Limit (West Coast Expressway\n\n(Taiping-Banting)) (Amendment) Order 2019.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 23 September 2019.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    }
