 "MY-H3393": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3393",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1)  This  order  may be cited as the Income Tax  (Exemption) (No. 10)\nOrder 2013.\n\n     (2)  This Order comes into operation on 12 August 2013.\n\nExemption"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2.  (1)  The Minister exempts BNM Kijang Berhad  or any holder of Sukuk Kijang\nfrom the payment of income tax in the basis period for a year of assessment in relation\nto any income derived from Sukuk Kijang.\n\n (2)  Nothing in subparagraph (1) shall absolve or is deemed to have absolved\nBNM Kijang Berhad or the holder of Sukuk Kijang from complying with any requirement\nto submit any return or statement of accounts or to furnish any other information under\nthe provisions of the Act.\n\n (3) For the purpose of this Order, \"Sukuk Kijang\" means the Islamic securities\nof nominal value of up to two hundred and fifty million United States dollars\n(USD$250,000,000) issued o r to be issued in accordance with the Sh ariah principle of\nIjarah by BNM Kijang Berhad.\n\nNon-application"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The provisions of section s 109 and 109B of the Act shall not apply to the income\nexempted under this Order.\n\nMade 6 August 2013\n[Perb.CR(8.09)681/2-61(SJ.18)JLD.12(SK.10);LHDN.01/35/(S)/45/51/231-2;\nPN(PU2)80/LXXI]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n             Second Minister of Finance\n\n[To  be  laid  before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 127(4) of the Income Tax\nAct 1967]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
