 "MY-H3413": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3413",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 4) Order 2017.\n\n(2)  This Order comes into operation on 18 September 2017.\n\nApplication"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Commodity Murabahah Term Financing -i Facility  obtained by the\nSyarikat Perumahan Negara Berhad:\n\nProvided that the aggregate of the outstanding principal amount under\nthe financing facility shall not exceed five hundred thirty million three\nhundred thousand ringgit (RM530,300,000.00); and\n\n(b) the guarantee provided or to be provided  by t he Government of Malaysia in\nrelation to the  financing facility referred to in subsubparagraph (a).\n\nRemission of tax"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any money payable under  any agreement, instrument\nand document in relation to the financing facility and guarantee referred to in\nparagraph 2 shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Syarikat Perumahan Negara Berhad to which the Loans Guarantee\n(Bodies Corporate) 1965 Act applies by virtue of the Loans Guarantee\n(Declaration of Bodies Corporate) (Syarikat Perumahan Negara Berhad)\nOrder 2017 [P.U. (A) 262/2017];\n\n(b) the financier of the financing facility referred to in paragraph 2; or\n\n(c) any party to any agreement , instrument and document in relation to the\nfinancing facility or guarantee referred to in paragraph 2, including any party\nto whom such agreement, instrument and document is transferred or\nassigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, instrument and document in relation to the financing facility and guarantee\nreferred to in paragraph 2 shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 12 September 2017\n[KK/SID/(S)/393/822; PN(PU2)232/XIII]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
