 "MY-H3423": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3423",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This Order may be cited as the Dangerous Drugs (Amendment) Citation.\nOrder 1984."
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Part III of the First Schedule to the Act is amended by— Amendment to\n\nPart III of\n(a) inserting the item \"Alfentanil\" immediately after the item Saw.\n\"Acetylmethadol\";                                                                            Act 234.\n\n(b) inserting the item \"Eticyclidine, N-ethyl-l-phenylcyclohexyl-\namine\" immediately after the item \"Ethylmethylthiam-\nbutene\"';\n\n(c) inserting the item \"Rolicyclidine, 1-(l-phenylcyclohexyl)\npyrrolidine\" immediately after the item \"Racemorphan\";\nand\n\n(d) inserting the item \"Tenocyclidine, 1-[1-(2-thienyl) cyclo-\nhexyl] piperidine\" immediately after the item \"Sufentanil\".\n\nMade the 20th June 1984.\n[KKM-55 (58) Bhg. 6; PN. (PU?) 214 Pt. IV.]\n\nDato' CHIN Hon NGIAN,\nMinister of Health\n| P.U. (A) 264.\n\nAKTA PENDAFTARAN PENJENAYAH DAN\nORANG-ORANG YANG TIDAK DIINGINI 1969\n\nPERINTAH PENDAFTARAN PENJENAYAH DAN ORANG-ORANG\nYANG TIDAK DIINGINI (PINDAAN) 1984\n\nPADA menjalankan kuasa-kuasa yang diberi oleh seksyen 15 (1)\nAkta Pendaftaran Penjenayah dan Orang-Orang Yang Tidak Akar.\nDiingini 1969, Menteri membuat perintah yang berikut:\n\n1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pendaftaran Pen- Nama.\njenayah dan Orang-Orang Yang Tidak Diingini (Pindaan) 1984.\n\n2. Bahagian I Jadual Kedua (Sabah, Sarawak dan Negeri-negeri Bidang bagi\nTanah Melayu) kepada Akta Pendaftaran Penjenayah dan Orang- Jadual Kedua.\nOrang Yang Tidak Diingini 1959, adalah dipinda dengan me-\n\nnambah di tempat yang sesuai, butiran yang berikut kepada\n\nsenarai butiran-butiran :\n\nBab dan Seksyen                Kesalahan\n\"Seksyen 298A ....    a    Berkaitan dengan ugama\"\n\nDiperbuat pada 27hb Jun 1984.\n(KDN. S. 9/192 Jld 5; PN. (PU?) 15.1\n\nDaTo' Musa HITAM,\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nP.U. (A) 264-265.                            894\n\nREGISTRATION OF CRIMINALS AND UNDESIRABLE\nPERSONS ACT 1969\n\nREGISTRATION OF CRIMINALS AND UNDESIRABLE PERSONS\n(AMENDMENT) ORDER 1984\n\nIn exercise of the powers conferred by section 15 (1) of the\nAct 7.       Registration of Criminals and Undesirable Persons Act 1969, the\nMinister makes the following order:\n\nCitation.     1. This Order may be cited as the Registration of Criminals\nand Undesirable Persons (Amendment) Order 1984.\n\nAmendment    2. Pant I of the Second Schedule (Sabah, Sarawak and States of\not Second      Malaya) to the Registration of Criminals and Undesirable Persons                 Q ))\nnaaa      Act 1969, is hereby amended by adding at the appropriate place,\nthe following item to the list of items:\nChapter and Sections              Offences\n\"Section 298a       vie    ...    Relating to Religion\"\n\nMade the 27th June 1984.\n(KDN. S. 9/192 Jld 5; PN. (PU?) 15.1\nDato' Musa Hitam,\nMinister of Home Affairs\n\n\\| P.U. (A) 265.\nAKTA KASTAM 1967\n\nPerintah Duti KASTAM (PENGECUALIAN) (No. 2)\n(PINDAAN) (No. 2) 1984\n\nPEMBETULAN\n\nDataM P.U. (A) 134 yang disiarkan pada 12hb April 1984 ganti-\nkan angka-angka \"26\" dalam ruang (1) yang terdapat dalam          a\nPerintah. tersebut, dengan angka-angka \"126\".\n\n[Sulit KE. HE. (96) 669/20-1; Perb. CR. (8.20) 116/1-65 (SJ. 1)\nVol 2; PN. (PU?) 338B.]\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCustoms DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (No. 2) (AMENDMENT)\n(No. 2) ORDER 1984\n\nCORRIGENDUM\n\nIn P.U. (A) 134 published on the 12th April 1984 substitute for\nthe figures \"26\" in column (1) appearing in the said Order, the\nfigures \"126\".\n\n[Sulit KE. HE. (96) 669/20-1; Perb. CR. (8.20) 116/1-65 (SJ. 1)\nVol 2; PN. (PU?) 338B.]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
