     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Malay Reservations (Federal Territory)\n\n(Amendment of Third Schedule) Order 2022.\n\n(2) This Order shall apply to the Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur.\n\nAmendment of Third Schedule"
