 "MY-H3459": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3459",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the RRIM-Consult Corporation\n(Winding Up And Dissolution) Order 2015.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 15 November 2015.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2.  In this Order―\n\n \"Corporation\" means the RRIM-Consult Corporation.\n\nWinding up and dissolution of Corporation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Corporation established under the Malaysian Rubber Board\n(Establishment of Corporation) (RRIM -Consult Corporation) Order 2001\n[P.U. (A) 390/2001] is wound up and dissolved.\n\nTransfer of powers, rights, etc."
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. All powers, rights, privileges, duties, liabilities and obligations which\nimmediately bef ore the coming into operation of this Order were those of the\nCorporation shall devolve on the Board from that date.\n\nTransfer of property"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "5. Any movable and immovable property which immediately before the comi ng\ninto operation of this Order  was vested in  the Corporation or any person acting on its\nbehalf shall, on that date, be vested in the Board.\n\nTransfer of moneys"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 6,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 6"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "6. All moneys in or due to be paid to the funds of the Corporation shall, on the\ncoming into operation of this Order, be transferred to and vested in the Board.\n\nExisting contracts"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 7,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 7"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "7. All deeds, bonds, agreements, instruments and working arrangements subsisting\nimmediately before the coming into operation of this Order and affecting any of the\nproperty transferred under Order 5 shall not b e affected by this Order and shall\ncontinue as if the Board had been named therein or had been a party thereto.\n\nContinuance of civil proceedings"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 8,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 8"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "8. (1) Any civil pro ceedings or any cause of action pending or existing\nimmediately before the coming into op eration of this Order, by or against the\nCorporation, may, on or after the coming into operation of this Order, be continued or\ninstituted by or against the Board as it might have been by or against the Corporation if\nthis Order had not been made.\n\n (2) Any appeal brought or any leave to appeal applied for on or after the\ncoming into operation of this Order against a decisi on given immediately before that\ndate in any legal proceedings to which the Corporation was a party may be brought by\nor against the Board.\n\nRevocation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 9,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 9"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "9. The Malaysian Rubber Board (Establishment of Corporation)\n(RRIM-Consult Corporation) Order 2001 [P.U. (A) 390/2001] is revoked.\n\nMade 9 October 2015\n[KPPK(S)423(06)628/2; PN(PU2)560/VIII]\n\nYB DATUK WIRA HJ. AHMAD BIN HJ. HAMZAH\nChairman\nMalaysian Rubber Board\n\nApproved 12 October 2015\n[KPPK(S)423(06)628/2; PN(PU2)560/VIII]\n\nYB DATUK AMAR DOUGLAS UGGAH EMBAS\nMinister of Plantation Industries and Commodities"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
