     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] is amended\n\nin the First Schedule under the heading of \"Negeri Perak Darul Ridzuan\"—\n\n(a) by substituting for item 11 the following item:\n\n\"11. (Route 60): Changkat Jering–Sri Manjung–Kampung Koh Road\n\nStarting from Route 5, Jelapang-Ipoh-Ayer Tawar Road\n\nat coordinates N 4.175210, E 100.708545 and ending at Route 1,\n\nIpoh Road–Butterworth Road at coordinates N 4.789038,\n\nE 100.720975 including its link road at coordinates N 4.788043,\n\nE 100.721804 within the boundaries of right of way as shown on\n\nMAP 2: CHANGKAT JERING-SRI MANJUNG-KAMPUNG KOH ROAD\n\n(a distance of 87.167km).\"; and\n\n(b) by substituting for MAP 2: FEDERAL ROADS OF STATE OF PERAK\n\nthe following map:\n\n\" MAP 2: CHANGKAT JERING-SRI MANJUNG-KAMPUNG KOH ROAD\n\n\".\n\n(c) by substituting for item 18 the following item:\n\n\"18. (Route 75): Bagan Serai–Kuala Kurau Road\n\nStarting from State and Federal road boundary\n\nat coordinates N 5.017459, E 100.433753 and ending\n\nat Route 1, Ipoh Road-Butterworth Road at coordinates N 5.013749,\n\nE 100.533426 including its link road at coordinates N 5.017133,\n\nE 100.427178 within the boundaries of right of way as shown\n\non MAP 15: BAGAN SERAI-KUALA KURAU ROAD\n\n(a distance of 13.122km).\"; and\n\n(d) by inserting after MAP 14: FEDERAL ROAD OF STATE OF PERAK\n\nthe following map:\n\n\"MAP 15: BAGAN SERAI-KUALA KURAU ROAD\n\nMade 23 August 2022\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/25; PN(PU2)391/Jld. 42]\n\n DATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Senior Minister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]\n\n\"."
