     "en": "2. The Schedule to the Optical Regulations 1994 [P.U. (A) 210/1994] is amended—\n\n(a) by substituting for Form 8 the following form:\n\n\"Form 8\n\n[Regulation 20]\n\nOPTICAL ACT 1991\n\n[Subsection 20(4)]\n\nOPTICAL REGULATIONS 1994\n\nFULL REGISTRATION CERTIFICATE FOR OPTICIAN\n\nIT IS HEREBY CERTIFIED THAT:\n\nName :\n\nIdentity Card No./Passport No. :\n\nFull Registration No. :\n\nholding the qualification of ………………………………………………………………………. has been\n\nfully registered as a registered optician under …………………………………\n\nof the Optical Act 1991 subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a)\n\n(b)\n\n(c)\n\nDate : ……………………….………………..\n\nChairman\n\n Malaysian Optical Council\n\n(b) by substituting for Form 9 the following form:\n\n\"Form 9\n\n[Regulation 20]\n\nOPTICAL ACT 1991\n\n[Subsection 20(4)]\n\nOPTICAL REGULATIONS 1994\n\nFULL REGISTRATION CERTIFICATE FOR OPTOMETRIST\n\nIT IS HEREBY CERTIFIED THAT:\n\nName :\n\nIdentity Card No./Passport No. :\n\nFull Registration No. :\n\nholding the qualification of ……………………….………………………………………………… has been\n\nfully registered as a registered optometrist under …………………………………\n\nof the Optical Act 1991 subject to the following conditions:\n\nFee of RM……….……………….. has been paid.\n\nReceipt No. ……….……………….. dated ……….………………..\"; and\n\n(a)\n\n(b)\n\n(c)\n\nDate : ……………………….………………..\n\nChairman\n\n Malaysian Optical Council\n\nMade 2 October 2018\n\n[KKM600-1/3/74/JLD2(15); PN(PU2)503/VII]\n\nDR. DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMinister of Health\n\nFee of RM……….……………….. has been paid.\n\nReceipt No. ……….……………….. dated ……….………………..\"."
