 "MY-H3637": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3637",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (Public Sector Home Financing Board)\n\nOrder2023.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 19 September 2023.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order—\n\n\"BF-i Facility\" means the Business Financing-i Facility obtained by\n\nthe Public Sector Home Financing Board from Bank Islam Malaysia Berhad with\n\nthe aggregate principal amount not exceeding one billion ringgit (RM1,000,000,000.00);\n\n\"guarantee\" means guarantee given or to be given by the Government of Malaysia\n\nin relation to the BF-i Facility.\n\nRemission of tax"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53] by—\n\n(a) the Public Sector Home Financing Board or Bank Islam Malaysia Berhad in\n\nrespect of any money payable under any agreement,\n\ninstrument and document in relation to the BF-i Facility and\n\nthe guarantee; or\n\n(b) any party to whom the agreement, instrument and document\n\nin relation to BF-i Facility is transferred or assigned,\n\nshall be remitted in full.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378] in respect of\n\nany agreement, instrument and document in relation to the BF-i Facility\n\nand the guarantee shall be remitted infull.\n\nMade 18 September 2023\n\n[MOF.SID(S)700-14/2/14 JLD.5; PN(PU2)232/JLD. 18]\n\nANWAR IBRAHIM\n\nMinister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
