 "MY-H3662": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3662",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1)   This order may be cited as the  Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 4) Order 2015.\n\n(2)  This Order comes into operation on 30 November 2015.\n\nInterpretation"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order—\n\n\"Guarantee\" means the guarantee provided or to be provided by the\nGovernment;\n\n\"Issuer\" means the Prasarana Malaysia Berhad  (formerly known as\nSyarikat Prasarana Negara  Berhad), to which the Act applies by virtue of th e\nLoans Guarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate) (Syarikat Prasarana Negara Berhad)\nOrder 2001  [P.U. (A) 351/2001];\n\n\"Sukuk Murabahah Programme\" means the Islamic Medium Term Notes\nProgramme of five billion ringgit (RM5,000,000,000.00) in nominal value; and\n\n\"Sukuk Murabahah\" means the Islamic Medium Term Notes issued pursuant to\nSukuk Murabahah Programme.\n\nRemission of tax"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "3. There shall be remitted in full any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53 ] in respect of any money payable under any agreement, note, instrument or\n\ndocument in relation to the Sukuk Murabahah Programme, Sukuk Murabahah  issued by\nthe Issuer or any agreement, note, instrument and document in relation to the\nGuarantee, by—\n\n (a) the Issuer;\n\n (b) any holder of the Sukuk Murabahah; or\n\n(c) any other party to any agreement, note, instrument and document in\nrelation to the Sukuk Murabahah Programme, Sukuk Murabahah or the\nGuarantee, including any party to whom such agreement, note,\ninstrument or document is transferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument an d document in relation to the Sukuk Murabahah\nProgramme, Sukuk Murabahah issued by the Issuer or in relation to the Guarantee shall\nbe remitted in full.\n\nMade 24 November 2015\n[KK/SID/(S)845/1/1; PN(PU2)232/XI]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
