     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Water Services Industry\n\n(Water Reticulation and Plumbing) (Amendment) (No. 2) Rules 2015.\n\n (2) These Rules, except subparagraph 2(a)(i), come into operation\n\non 1 December 2015.\n\n(3) Subparagraph 2(a)(i) of these Rules comes into operation\n\non 30 November 2017.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
