 "MY-H3790": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3790",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Excise Duties (Tioman) (Amendment)\n\nOrder 2016.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 November 2016.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Excise Duties (Tioman) Order 2004 [P.U. (A) 242/2004] is amended in\n\nparagraph 2—\n\n(a) by inserting after the words \"motor vehicles\" the words \", intoxicating\n\nliquors, tobacco products and cigarettes\"; and\n\n(b) by substituting for the words \"prevailing specified rates\" the words \"rates\n\nspecified in column 4 to the Schedule of the prevailing Excise Duties Order\".\n\nMade 31 October 2016\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-2 Sk. 10; Perb. CR(8.20)116/1-138(2016)(SJ.8)(SK.1);\n\nPN(PU2)337]\n\nDATUK JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\n\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 91I(2) of the Excise Act 1976]"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H3792": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3792",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译；2026-10-28 自 OCR 阶段产物回填（首轮分卷覆盖丢失）。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Price Marking of Price-Controlled Goods) (No. 3) Order 2018.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period fr om 3 November 2018\nto 9 November 2018.\n\nPrice marking"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Any person who sells or offers to sell any price -controlled goods published\nin the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering (Determination of Maximum Price)  (No. 4)\nOrder 2018 [P.U. (A) 284/2018] shall affix a pink coloured label indicating the price  per\nunit or per unit weight, the name describing such price-controlled goods and the grade\nor quality, if any, of such price-controlled goods.\n\n (2) Any person who fails t o comply with subparagraph (1) commits\nan offence and shall, on conviction, be liable—\n\n(a) if such person is a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding\ntwenty thousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent o ffence, to a\nfine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit; or\n\n(b) if such person is not a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding\nten thousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence, to a fine\nnot exceeding twenty thousand ringgit.\n\nMade 31 October 2018\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMinister of Domestic Trade\nand Consumer Affairs"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
