     "en": "2. The Street, Drainage and Building (Desludging of Septic Tank and Imhoff Tank\n\nCharges) (Federal Territory) By-Laws 1983 [P.U. (A) 490/1983] published on\n\n1 December 1983 are revoked.\n\nMade 5 January 2012\n\n[KWP(S): 24/PUU/698/1/1/37; PN(PU2)252/VIII]\n\nDATO' RAJA NONG CHIK BIN DATO' RAJA ZAINAL ABIDIN\n\nMinister of Federal Territories and Urban Wellbeing"
